It's time to begin!\n\n\n**Orchestrating Workflow Steps**\n\nI'm structuring the execution now, ensuring the code-reviewer is always the final step for adherence. The current focus centers on defining distinct stages: architecture, code review, and output publication. I'm prioritizing this final check.\n\n\n**Finalizing Sequential Plan**\n\nI'm now satisfied with the sequential plan, ensuring the code-reviewer is the final step. The architect generates the content, and then the code-reviewer assesses code quality, integrates findings, and creates the final deliverables. I've crafted detailed prompts for each agent.\n\n\n**Finalizing Sequential Plan**\n\nNow I'm completely ready to execute. I've broken the work into stages, with the architect handling the architecture and ADRs, and then the code reviewer integrating the assessments and outputting files. I'm confident in this plan.\n\n\n**Finalizing the Execution Plan**\n\nI've crafted and refined the `finish` call, and I'm ready to begin processing the user request. The plan adheres to constraints. I've broken the work into a sequential two-phase execution, with clear instructions for the architect and code-reviewer. Now, I'm ready to run.\n\n\n","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"I will now decompose the user's request into a two-phase execution plan.\n\n*   **Phase 1: Architecture Review**: An `architect` agent will review the architecture, draft the three requested Architecture Decision Records (ADRs), and formulate recommendations for Phase 2.\n*   **Phase 2: Code Quality and Integration**: A `code-reviewer` agent will perform a detailed code quality assessment, and then integrate its findings with the architect's work to produce the final document artifacts.\n\nThis sequential plan ensures that the `code-reviewer` acts as the final quality gate, in accordance with the system guidelines. I will now define and execute this plan."},"usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":"18951","cachedContentTokenCount":"0","ca