efined the task prompts for each agent, focusing on clear instructions and single-file outputs, in alignment with user specifications. The \"architect\" now has separate tasks to assess the architecture and draft individual ADRs, each targeting a specific output file. I've ensured all instructions are incorporated, including the detailed questions and templates provided by the user. The `code-reviewer` agent gets the last stage.\n\n\n","text":""}}
