,{"text":"   - Any unhandled exceptions?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3. **Testing**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Coverage adequate (>80%)?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Edge cases tested?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Integration tests sufficient?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4. **Code Organization**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Modules appropriately separated?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - File sizes reasonable?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Imports clean (no circular)?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"5. **Reproducibility**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Are random seeds controlled?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Can anyone run training with same results?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Checkpoints include all needed state?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"---","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 4. Recommendations for Phase 2","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"After reviewing Phase 1 architecture, provide recommendations:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1. **Things to Keep**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - What worked well?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - What's solid foundation?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2. **Things to Improve**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Any refactoring suggestions?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Any optimizations?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Any technical debt?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_A