2026-06-08 18:10:24,586 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"76","timestampMicros":"1780938624585673","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"acac9125090623f6f38f8a725689d2f9","trajectoryId":"acac9125090623f6f38f8a725689d2f9","stepIndex":6,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Writing content for ADR-002","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/.gemini/antigravity/brain/acac9125090623f6f38f8a725689d2f9/scratch/task5_instructions/adr2.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":0,"lines":[{"text":"# ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation for Cold-Start Training","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Status","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"ACCEPTED","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Phase 1 MVP must train anomaly detector before accessing real customer data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Traditional SCADA blindness means we can't test on real greenhouse infrastructure failures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Must generate realistic normal behavior to establish baseline.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Problem","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"How to generate training data when real greenhouse data unavailable?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Options:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1. **Synthetic data** (chosen): TimeGAN-inspired generator","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2. **Public datasets**: Limited, different crops/climates","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3. **Simulation**: Custom greenhouse simulator (expensive)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4. **Hybrid**: Synthetic + limited real data (Phase 1.5)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Decision","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Build **TimeGAN-inspired synthetic data generator**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Temperature: 20-30°C, realistic gradients","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Humidity: 50-80%, correlated with temperature","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- CO₂: 300-500 ppm, slow drift","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Light: 0-1000 lux day/night cycle","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- 1000 sequences, 20 timesteps","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Reproducible (fixed random seed)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Rationale","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1. **Sufficient**: 1000 sequences adequate for VAE training","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2. **Realistic**: Correlations and constraints enforced","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3. **Reproducible**: Same seed = same data (important for research)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4. **Fast**: Generated on-the-fly, no storage needed","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"5. **Tunable**: Easy to adjust ranges for different climates","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Consequences","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Not identical to real greenhouse data (unavoidable at Phase 1)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Model may need tuning when customer data arrives (Phase 2: transfer learning)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Synthetic validation only; real validation delayed to Phase 2","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Correlations hardcoded; real data may have different patterns","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Alternatives Reconsidered","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Real data unavailable until Phase 2 (blocking constraint)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Simpler random generation would lose correlations","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- More complex simulation deferred to Phase 2 if needed","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
