2026-06-08 18:10:24,635 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"78","timestampMicros":"1780938624635467","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"acac9125090623f6f38f8a725689d2f9","trajectoryId":"acac9125090623f6f38f8a725689d2f9","stepIndex":7,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Writing content for ADR-003","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/.gemini/antigravity/brain/acac9125090623f6f38f8a725689d2f9/scratch/task5_instructions/adr3.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":0,"lines":[{"text":"# ADR-003: Modular Architecture for Easy Phase 1.5 Scaling","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Status","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"ACCEPTED","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Phase 1: Single model, single customer","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Phase 1.5: Model adaptation infrastructure, 3-5 customers with different crops/conditions","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Phase 2: Multi-customer platform with vendor integration","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Must design Phase 1 to avoid major refactoring at Phase 1.5.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Problem","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"How to structure Phase 1 code to enable Phase 1.5 multi-customer scaling?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Decision","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Three design principles:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1. **Separated Concerns**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Models (src/models/) independent of data/API","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Data loading (src/data/) independent of model","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Database (Phase 2) independent of model","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2. **Configuration-Driven**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - No hardcoded paths, hyperparameters in config.py","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Easy to adjust for different greenhouse types","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Environment variables for deployment flexibility","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3. **Pluggable Components**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Data generator can be swapped for real data loader (Phase 1.5)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Training script can handle multiple models (Phase 1.5)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"   - Database schema extensible (Phase 2 additions)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Rationale","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1. **Minimal Refactoring**: <20% of Phase 1 work at Phase 1.5","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2. **Reusability**: Base model can transfer to new customers","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3. **Testability**: Each component independently testable","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4. **Maintainability**: Clear interfaces between components","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Consequences","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Slightly more abstraction than needed for Phase 1","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- More files/classes (vs monolithic script)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Configuration management overhead (mitigated by defaults)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Code Structure","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"src/","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"├── models/           # Model definitions (same for all customers)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"│   ├── lstm_vae.py","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"│   ├── data_generator.py  # Swappable with real loader","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"│   └── training.py","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"├── data/             # Data loading (will expand Phase 1.5)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"│   └── csv_loader.py","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"└── config.py         # All hardcoded values here","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Phase 1.5 additions:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"├── data/","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"│   ├── priva_loader.py         # NEW: Priva API integration","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"│   └── greenhouse_adapter.py    # NEW: Vendor-agnostic adapter","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"├── models/","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"│   └── model_adapter.py         # NEW: Transfer learning","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"└── database/         # NEW: Customer data storage","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Phase 1.5 Refactoring Budget","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Data loading: 30% new code, 0% existing code changes","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Model adaptation: 20% new code, 5% existing code changes","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Database layer: 50% new code, 0% existing code changes","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Total: ~<20% effort relative to Phase 1","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
