2026-06-08 18:11:00,147 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"15","timestampMicros":"1780938660147057","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"51492f9af226d4bc3816132a0e953ea3","trajectoryId":"51492f9af226d4bc3816132a0e953ea3","stepIndex":8,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Create ADR-002","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data-generation.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":31,"lines":[{"text":"# ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation for Model Training","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Status:** Accepted","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"# ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation for Cold-Start Training","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Status","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"ACCEPTED","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"The LSTM-VAE anomaly detection model requires a significant amount of time-series data for training. In the initial phases of the project, a complete and labeled real-world dataset from the greenhouse sensors is not yet available. To avoid blocking the development of the model training and validation pipelines, we need a substitute dataset that closely resembles the expected real-world data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"Phase 1 MVP must train anomaly detector before accessing real customer data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Traditional SCADA blindness means we can't test on real greenhouse infrastructure failures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Must generate realistic normal behavior to establish baseline.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Problem","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"How to generate training data when real greenhouse data unavailable?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Options:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1. **Synthetic data** (chosen): TimeGAN-inspired generator","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2. **Public datasets**: Limited, different crops/climates","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3. **Simulation**: Custom greenhouse simulator (expensive)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4. **Hybrid**: Synthetic + limited real data (Phase 1.5)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Decision","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"We will generate a synthetic dataset of greenhouse sensor readings. This dataset will mimic the expected characteristics of real data, including:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Sensors:** Temperature, Humidity, CO2, and Light levels.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Temporal Patterns:** Realistic day/night cycles and seasonal variations.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Noise:** Introduction of random noise to simulate sensor inaccuracies.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Data Shape:** The data will conform to the model's required input shape of `(batch_size, seq_len=20, input_dim=4)`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"The implementation of the synthetic data generator is located in `src/models/data_generator.py`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"Build **TimeGAN-inspired synthetic data generator**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Temperature: 20-30°C, realistic gradients","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Humidity: 50-80%, correlated with temperature","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- CO₂: 300-500 ppm, slow drift","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Light: 0-1000 lux day/night cycle","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- 1000 sequences, 20 timesteps","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Reproducible (fixed random seed)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Rationale","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1. **Sufficient**: 1000 sequences adequate for VAE training","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2. **Realistic**: Correlations and constraints enforced","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3. **Reproducible**: Same seed = same data (important for research)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4. **Fast**: Generated on-the-fly, no storage needed","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"5. **Tunable**: Easy to adjust ranges for different climates","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Consequences","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Positive","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Enables Parallel Development:** Allows the ML team to proceed with model development, training, and testing without waiting for the data acquisition pipeline to be completed.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Provides a Baseline:** Establishes a baseline for model performance and helps in iterating on the model architecture and hyperparameters.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Facilitates Pipeline Testing:** Allows for end-to-end testing of the data loading, preprocessing, and training pipelines.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Controlled Anomaly Injection:** Provides a framework for injecting controlled anomalies into the dataset for testing the model's detection capabilities.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Negative","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Model-Reality Gap:** The synthetic data, while realistic, will not capture the full complexity and unforeseen patterns of real-world sensor data. The model will need to be retrained and validated on real data as soon as it becomes available.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Maintenance Overhead:** The synthetic data generator will require maintenance and updates as our understanding of the real-world data evolves.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- Not identical to real greenhouse data (unavoidable at Phase 1)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Model may need tuning when customer data arrives (Phase 2: transfer learning)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Synthetic validation only; real validation delayed to Phase 2","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Correlations hardcoded; real data may have different patterns","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Alternatives Reconsidered","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Real data unavailable until Phase 2 (blocking constraint)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Simpler random generation would lose correlations","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- More complex simulation deferred to Phase 2 if needed","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
