2026-06-08 18:11:04,297 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"36","timestampMicros":"1780938664296167","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"c05aad7750beac56911bbe90d3c5cf90","trajectoryId":"c05aad7750beac56911bbe90d3c5cf90","stepIndex":12,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Create ADR-001","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/architecture/ADR-001-lstm-vae-architecture.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":0,"lines":[{"text":"# ADR-001: LSTM-VAE Architecture for Anomaly Detection","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Status","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"ACCEPTED","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Phase 1 MVP needs to detect greenhouse anomalies (equipment failures, parameter drift) ","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"invisible to traditional SCADA. We must train on normal behavior to detect deviations.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Key requirement: Unsupervised learning (no anomaly labels).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Problem","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"What architecture best detects infrastructure failures in time-series sensor data?","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Options considered:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1. **LSTM-Autoencoder**: Simple, fast, proven for time-series","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2. **LSTM-VAE** (chosen): Probabilistic, better outlier detection, learns distribution","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3. **GAN**: Harder to train, mode collapse risk","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4. **Isolation Forest**: Shallow, limited temporal understanding","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"5. **Hybrid ensemble**: More complex, future option","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Decision","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Use **LSTM-VAE** with 2-layer encoder/decoder, 8D latent space.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Architecture:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Input: (batch, 20 timesteps, 4 sensors)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Encoder LSTM: 64 → 32 hidden dims","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Latent: 8-dimensional distribution","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Decoder LSTM: Mirror of encoder","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Loss: Reconstruction (MSE) + KL divergence (beta=0.1)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Rationale","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1. **Unsupervised**: Learns normal behavior without labels","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2. **Probabilistic**: VAE gives uncertainty estimates","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3. **Temporal**: LSTM captures temporal patterns","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4. **Interpretable**: Reconstruction error is anomaly signal","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"5. **Proven**: VAEs proven for time-series anomaly detection in industry","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"6. **Scalable**: 8D latent space is interpretable but flexible","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Consequences","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Training required on normal data (Phase 1: synthetic, Phase 2: customer data)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Inference latency: ~10ms per sequence (acceptable)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Requires GPU for real-time multi-customer deployment (Phase 2)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Better anomaly detection but higher complexity than simple autoencoder","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Alternatives Reconsidered","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Isolation Forest added as secondary anomaly detector (Phase 2)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- LSTMs for direct forecasting (alternative, deferred)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
