age. Mathematical stability, physical data constraints, and tensor shaping across batches are verified. ","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture README**: Located in `src/models/README.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-002**: Synthetic Data Generation ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data-generation.md`..","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-002**: Synthetic Data Generation ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data-generation.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-003**: Modular Architecture for Easy Phase 1.5 Scaling ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-phase-1-5-architecture.md`..","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending / Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ⬜ **Local Dev Environment / Dockerization** (Task 4): The devops local dev setup (Docker Compose) needs to be configured and tested to wrap this architecture reliably.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Framework**: PyTorch.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Data Shapes**: `(batch_size, seq_len=20, input_dim=4)`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Sensors**: Temperature, Humidity, CO2, Light.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
