2026-06-08 18:11:47,795 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"63","timestampMicros":"1780938707795174","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"c05aad7750beac56911bbe90d3c5cf90","trajectoryId":"c05aad7750beac56911bbe90d3c5cf90","stepIndex":20,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Update AGENT_MEMORY.md","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/AGENT_MEMORY.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":26,"lines":[{"text":"# Agent Memory & Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Project: AI Agronomist (Greenhouse Anomaly Detection)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"**Current Phase**: Phase 1 MVP - ML Foundation Tasks","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Completed Tasks (Week 1, Tasks 1, 2 & 3)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **LSTM-VAE Architecture** (`src/models/lstm_vae.py`): Implemented with 2 LSTM layers in encoder/decoder and 8-dim latent space. Model includes type hints and docstrings.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Synthetic Data Generator** (`src/models/data_generator.py`): Implemented basic realistic normal greenhouse sensor data with day/night cycles.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Data Utilities** (`src/models/data_utils.py`): Data loading, preprocessing, dataloader creation, and denormalization.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Configuration** (`src/config.py`): Hyperparameters for the model, training, and data generation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Training Pipeline** (`src/models/training.py`, `scripts/train_lstm_vae.py`): Training loops with early stopping, validation metrics, checkpointing, and tensorboard logging fully operational.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Unit Testing & Validation** (`tests/`): Pytest suite includes 117 tests with exactly 80.00% code coverage. Mathematical stability, physical data constraints, and tensor shaping across batches are verified. ","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture README**: Located in `src/models/README.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-001**: LSTM-VAE Architecture ADR at `docs/architecture/ADR-001-lstm-vae-architecture.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-002**: Synthetic Data Generation ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data-generation.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-003**: Modular Architecture for Easy Phase 1.5 Scaling ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-phase-1-5-architecture.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture Assessment**: Completed a full architecture assessment, documented in `docs/team/ADRs/ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending / Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ⬜ **Local Dev Environment / Dockerization** (Task 4): The devops local dev setup (Docker Compose) needs to be configured and tested to wrap this architecture reliably.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ⬜ **Review architecture assessment and implement recommendations.**","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Framework**: PyTorch.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Data Shapes**: `(batch_size, seq_len=20, input_dim=4)`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Sensors**: Temperature, Humidity, CO2, Light.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
