2026-06-08 18:32:21,231 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"10","timestampMicros":"1780939941230872","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"47a103a70aad60504bd6cef88a0452bc","trajectoryId":"47a103a70aad60504bd6cef88a0452bc","stepIndex":2,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"API and dashboard design","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/architecture/api_dashboard_design.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":0,"lines":[{"text":"# AI Agronomist: API, Dashboard, and Adapter Architecture","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"This document outlines the architecture for the REST API, the Streamlit monitoring dashboard, the high-level database schema, and the vendor data adapter for the AI Agronomist platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 1. REST API Architecture","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"The REST API provides endpoints for health checks, data ingestion, and model inference. It is designed to be multi-tenant and scalable.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### 1.1 Endpoints","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"#### `GET /health`","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Description**: Performs a basic health check of the API service.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Request**: None","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Response (200 OK)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```json","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"status\": \"ok\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  }","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Response (503 Service Unavailable)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```json","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"status\": \"error\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"reason\": \"Service is unhealthy\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  }","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"#### `GET /health/db`","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Description**: Checks the health of the database connection.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Request**: None","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Response (200 OK)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```json","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"status\": \"ok\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  }","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Response (503 Service Unavailable)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```json","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"status\": \"error\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"reason\": \"Database connection failed\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  }","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"#### `POST /api/upload`","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Description**: Uploads a batch of sensor data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Request Body**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```json","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"tenant_id\": \"customer_a\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"readings\": [","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"      {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"timestamp\": \"2026-06-08T18:32:02Z\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"sensor_id\": \"gh1-temp-01\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"temperature\": 25.5,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"humidity\": 60.1,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"light_intensity\": 55000,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"co2_level\": 450","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"      }","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    ]","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  }","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Response (202 Accepted)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```json","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"status\": \"queued\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"message\": \"Data accepted for processing.\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  }","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"#### `POST /api/inference`","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Description**: Requests real-time anomaly detection for a sequence of sensor readings.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Request Body**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```json","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"tenant_id\": \"customer_a\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"sensor_id\": \"gh1-temp-01\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"readings\": [","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"      { \"temperature\": 25.5, \"humidity\": 60.1, \"light_intensity\": 55000, \"co2_level\": 450 },","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"      ... 19 more readings","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    ]","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  }","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Response (200 OK)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```json","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"tenant_id\": \"customer_a\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"sensor_id\": \"gh1-temp-01\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"is_anomaly\": true,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"reconstruction_error\": 0.87","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  }","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  ```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### 1.2 Error Handling","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **400 Bad Request**: For validation errors (e.g., missing fields, incorrect data types). The response body will contain a `details` field with specific error messages.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **429 Too Many Requests**: When the rate limit is exceeded.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **500 Internal Server Error**: For unhandled server-side exceptions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### 1.3 Rate Limiting","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"A token bucket algorithm will be implemented using a middleware. Each `tenant_id` will have a separate bucket, allowing for customer-specific rate limits.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 2. Streamlit Dashboard","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"The dashboard provides a user-friendly interface for monitoring sensor data and anomalies.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### 2.1 Pages","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **`sensor_data.py`**: Displays historical sensor data in charts and tables.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **`anomalies.py`**: Shows a list of detected anomalies with relevant context.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **`thresholds.py`**: Allows users to view and adjust anomaly detection thresholds.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **`metrics.py`**: Presents model performance metrics like precision, recall, and F1-score.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### 2.2 State Management","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **`st.session_state`**: To store user session data like the selected `tenant_id`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **`st.cache_data`**: To cache data loaded from the database, reducing redundant queries.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### 2.3 Real-time Refresh","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"The dashboard will include a manual refresh button and an optional auto-refresh toggle that re-queries the data every 60 seconds.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### 2.4 Multi-Tenant UI","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"A dropdown menu in the sidebar will allow users to select their `tenant_id`, which will then be used to filter all data displayed in the dashboard.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 3. Database Schema","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### 3.1 `SensorReading` Table","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```sql","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"CREATE TABLE SensorReadings (","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    timestamp TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    tenant_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    sensor_id VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    temperature FLOAT,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    humidity FLOAT,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    light_intensity INTEGER,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    co2_level INTEGER,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    PRIMARY KEY (timestamp, tenant_id, sensor_id)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":");","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### 3.2 Indexes","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- A composite index on `(tenant_id, sensor_id, timestamp)` will be created to optimize queries for a specific sensor within a tenant.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 4. Vendor Adapter Architecture","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"A modular adapter system will be designed to ingest data from various sensor vendors. Each adapter will be a separate Python module responsible for:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1.  Fetching data from the vendor's API or data source.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2.  Transforming the data into the canonical `SensorReading` format.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3.  Posting the normalized data to the `/api/upload` endpoint.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"This design decouples the core application from vendor-specific data formats.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
