2026-06-08 18:32:51,777 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"27","timestampMicros":"1780939971776707","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"2060e988590ca7b582c12c398ed48492","trajectoryId":"2060e988590ca7b582c12c398ed48492","stepIndex":6,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Create vendor adapter design document","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/architecture/vendor_adapter_design.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":0,"lines":[{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"# Vendor Adapter Design","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Status:** Proposed","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Author:** Architect","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Date:** 2026-06-08","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 1. Overview","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"This document outlines the design for the Vendor Adapter system, a crucial component for ingesting sensor data from various greenhouse control system vendors. The primary goal is to create a pluggable architecture that allows for the easy addition of new vendors without requiring changes to the core data processing pipeline.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"This is achieved by defining a standardized interface that each vendor-specific adapter must implement. This ensures that data, regardless of its source, is transformed into a canonical format that the rest of the AI Agronomist platform can understand.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 2. Abstract Vendor Interface","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"All vendor adapters must inherit from an abstract base class, `AbstractVendorAdapter`, which defines the contract for data ingestion.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### `AbstractVendorAdapter` Specification","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```python","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"from abc import ABC, abstractmethod","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"import pandas as pd","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"class AbstractVendorAdapter(ABC):","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    Abstract interface for all vendor-specific data adapters.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    @abstractmethod","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def connect(self) -> None:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        Establishes a connection to the vendor's data source.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        This could be a file path, a database connection, or an API client.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        Raises ConnectionError on failure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        pass","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    @abstractmethod","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def disconnect(self) -> None:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        Closes the connection to the data source.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        pass","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    @abstractmethod","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def read_data(self) -> pd.DataFrame:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        Reads data from the source and returns it as a Pandas DataFrame.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        The DataFrame returned by this method is expected to have raw,","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        vendor-specific column names.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        :return: A DataFrame with the raw sensor data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        :raises: DataReadError if data cannot be read.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        pass","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    @abstractmethod","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def normalize_data(self, raw_data: pd.DataFrame) -> pd.DataFrame:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        Transforms the raw data into the canonical format.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        :param raw_data: A DataFrame with vendor-specific columns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        :return: A DataFrame with standardized column names and data types.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        pass","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def get_data(self) -> pd.DataFrame:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        A template method that orchestrates the data ingestion process.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        self.connect()","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        try:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"            raw_data = self.read_data()","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"            normalized_data = self.normalize_data(raw_data)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"            return normalized_data","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        finally:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"            self.disconnect()","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### Input/Output Contracts","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Input:** Each adapter is responsible for handling its specific data format (e.g., CSV file, API response, database table).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Output:** The `get_data` method on any implemented adapter will always return a `pandas.DataFrame` with the following canonical schema:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `timestamp`: `datetime64[ns, UTC]` - The timestamp of the sensor reading.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `temperature`: `float64` - Temperature in degrees Celsius.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `humidity`: `float64` - Relative humidity percentage (0-100).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `co2`: `float64` - CO2 concentration in parts per million (PPM).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `light_intensity`: `float64` - Light intensity in micromoles per square meter per second (µmol/m²/s).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### Error Handling","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- `ConnectionError`: Raised by the `connect` method if the adapter cannot establish a connection with the data source.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- `DataReadError`: Raised by the `read_data` method if the data cannot be fetched from the source after a successful connection.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- `ValidationError`: Raised by the `normalize_data` method if the raw data does not conform to the expected format (e.g., missing columns, incorrect data types).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 3. Concrete Implementations","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### a. CSV Adapter","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"The `CSVAdapter` is the first implementation, designed to read data from local CSV files. This is primarily for testing, model development, and handling manual data exports.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Implementation Details:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- `connect()`: Checks if the specified CSV file path exists.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- `read_data()`: Reads the CSV into a DataFrame using `pd.read_csv()`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- `normalize_data()`: Renames columns based on a provided mapping and converts data types to match the canonical schema.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Example Usage:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```python","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"# Hypothetical usage","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"mapping = {","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"DateTime\": \"timestamp\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"Temp_C\": \"temperature\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"RH_percent\": \"humidity\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"CO2_ppm\": \"co2\",","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"Light_umol\": \"light_intensity\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"}","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"csv_adapter = CSVAdapter(filepath=\"/path/to/data.csv\", column_mapping=mapping)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"data = csv_adapter.get_data()","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### b. Priva Adapter (Stub)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Priva is a common greenhouse control system. An adapter will be built to integrate with their API. This section serves as a placeholder for that future work.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Implementation Sketch:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```python","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"class PrivaAdapter(AbstractVendorAdapter):","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def __init__(self, api_key: str, api_endpoint: str):","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        self.api_key = api_key","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        self.api_endpoint = api_endpoint","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        self.client = None","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def connect(self):","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        # Initialize and authenticate API client","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        # self.client = PrivaApiClient(api_key=self.api_key)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        # self.client.authenticate()","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        pass","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def disconnect(self):","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        # self.client.close_session()","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        pass","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def read_data(self):","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        # Fetch data from self.api_endpoint","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        # return response_to_dataframe(self.client.get(...))","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        pass","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    def normalize_data(self, raw_data: pd.DataFrame) -> pd.DataFrame:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        # Rename and cast columns from the Priva API response","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        pass","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"```","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 4. Data Normalization Layer","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"The normalization layer is not a separate component but rather a responsibility of each adapter, implemented within the `normalize_data` method. This design choice keeps all vendor-specific logic encapsulated within its own adapter.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Responsibilities:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1.  **Column Mapping:** Each adapter will contain a mapping from vendor-specific column names to the canonical names.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2.  **Unit Conversion:** If a vendor provides data in a non-standard unit (e.g., Temperature in Fahrenheit), the adapter must convert it to the canonical unit (Celsius).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3.  **Data Type Casting:** Ensure all columns in the final DataFrame match the data types defined in the canonical schema.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4.  **Timezone Handling:** All timestamps must be converted to UTC.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## 5. Future Extensibility","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"The adapter pattern makes it straightforward to add new vendors. The process for adding a `NewVendorAdapter` would be:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1.  Create a new class `NewVendorAdapter` that inherits from `AbstractVendorAdapter`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2.  Implement the `connect`, `disconnect`, `read_data`, and `normalize_data` methods with the logic specific to that vendor's API or data format.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3.  Instantiate `NewVendorAdapter` in the data ingestion service, configured with the necessary credentials or paths.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"4.  No changes would be needed in the core application logic, as it only interacts with the `AbstractVendorAdapter` interface.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"This design decouples the data acquisition logic from the data processing and modeling logic, ensuring the long-term maintainability of the AI Agronomist platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
