astAPI instantiation, CORS (access for Streamlit), exception handler filters (422, 404, 500), request ID middleware configuration, and health monitoring diagnostics interfaces.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Database Session Router** (`src/db/session.py`): Configured SQLite asynchronous backend with SQLAlchemy 2.x async, get_db session dependency injection helper, and init_db startup hook.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API & Boilerplate Unit Tests** (`tests/api/test_main.py`): Implemented thorough unit tests covering CORS, health checks, exception formatting, and mocked db failures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Unit Testing & Validation** (`tests/`): Pytest suite includes tests for mathematical stability, physical data constraints, and tensor shaping across batches.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture README**: Located in `src/models/README.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-001**: LSTM-VAE Architecture ADR at `docs/architecture/ADR-001-lstm-vae-architecture.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-002**: Synthetic Data Generation ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data-generation.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-003**: Modular Architecture for Easy Phase 1.5 Scaling ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-phase-1-5-architecture.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture Assessment**: Completed a full architecture assessment, documented in `docs/team/ADRs/ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending / Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ⬜ **SQLAlchemy Models** (`src/db/models.py`): Multi-tenant `SensorReading` index schema definition.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ⬜ **FastAPI Schema Validation** (`src/api/schemas/sensor_data.py`): Pydantic validation payload schemas.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ⬜ **Local Dev Environment / Dockerization**: Configure devops docker-compose development context.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Database Models** (`src/db/models.py`, `src/db/__init__.py`, `tests/unit/test_db_models.py`): Designed isomorphically standard SQLAlchemy 2.x declarative schemas and a reusable `Base` class mapping. Established validation tests on in-memory SQLite backend demonstrating proper indexing for `tenant_id` and `timestamp`, timezone support, structural safety, nullable fields, and default column values.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- ✅ **Alembic Database Migrations Suite** (`alembic.ini`, `src/db/migrations/env.py`, `src/db/migrations/script.py.mako`): Configured the entire migration facility leveraging local SQLAlchemy models. Integrated offline/online run configuration, dynamic environment variables connection overrides, and critical SQLite support with `render_as_batch=True`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"xt.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Framework**: PyTorch, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.x Async.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Database**: SQLite + aiosqlite as modern development proxy engine.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Data Shapes**: `(batch_size, seq_len=20, input_dim=4)`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Sensors**: Temperature, Humidity, CO2, Light.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
