2026-06-08 18:35:18,913 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"151","timestampMicros":"1780940118913377","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"f07c075fd11748a1a9ffa80dde4527bf","trajectoryId":"f07c075fd11748a1a9ffa80dde4527bf","stepIndex":51,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Updating Completed Tasks in AGENT_MEMORY.md","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/AGENT_MEMORY.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":30,"lines":[{"text":"# Agent Memory & Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Project: AI Agronomist (Greenhouse Anomaly Detection)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"**Current Phase**: Phase 2 — API & DB Foundation","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Completed Tasks (Week 1 & Week 2 Foundation)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **LSTM-VAE Architecture** (`src/models/lstm_vae.py`): Implemented with 2 LSTM layers in encoder/decoder and 8-dim latent space. Model includes type hints and docstrings.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Synthetic Data Generator** (`src/models/data_generator.py`): Implemented basic realistic normal greenhouse sensor data with day/night cycles.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Data Utilities** (`src/models/data_utils.py`): Data loading, preprocessing, dataloader creation, and denormalization.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Configuration** (`src/config.py`): Hyperparameters for the model, training, and data generation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Training Pipeline** (`src/models/training.py`, `scripts/train_lstm_vae.py`): Training loops with early stopping, validation metrics, checkpointing, and tensorboard logging fully operational.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API Boilerplate Structure** (`src/api/main.py`): Implemented initial REST API foundation, including FastAPI instantiation, CORS (access for Streamlit), exception handler filters (422, 404, 500), request ID middleware configuration, and health monitoring diagnostics interfaces.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Database Session Router** (`src/db/session.py`): Configured SQLite asynchronous backend with SQLAlchemy 2.x async, get_db session dependency injection helper, and init_db startup hook.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API & Boilerplate Unit Tests** (`tests/api/test_main.py`): Implemented thorough unit tests covering CORS, health checks, exception formatting, and mocked db failures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Unit Testing & Validation** (`tests/`): Pytest suite includes tests for mathematical stability, physical data constraints, and tensor shaping across batches.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture README**: Located in `src/models/README.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-001**: LSTM-VAE Architecture ADR at `docs/architecture/ADR-001-lstm-vae-architecture.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-002**: Synthetic Data Generation ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data-generation.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-003**: Modular Architecture for Easy Phase 1.5 Scaling ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-phase-1-5-architecture.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture Assessment**: Completed a full architecture assessment, documented in `docs/team/ADRs/ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Pydantic V2 Schemas** (`src/api/schemas/sensor_data.py`): Implemented core API data transfer schema representations including boundary validations for sensor bounds (temperature, humidity, CO2, light) and dynamic tensor dimension shape verification checks.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- ✅ **Pydantic Schemas Unit Tests** (`tests/api/test_sensor_data_schemas.py`): Created comprehensive schema verification tests checking valid ranges, ORM configurations, nested data structures, and sequence dimensions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending / Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Database Models** (`src/db/models.py`, `src/db/__init__.py`, `tests/unit/test_db_models.py`): Designed isomorphically standard SQLAlchemy 2.x declarative schemas and a reusable `Base` class mapping. Established validation tests on in-memory SQLite backend demonstrating proper indexing for `tenant_id` and `timestamp`, timezone support, structural safety, nullable fields, and default column values.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Alembic Database Migrations Suite** (`alembic.ini`, `src/db/migrations/env.py`, `src/db/migrations/script.py.mako`): Configured the entire migration facility leveraging local SQLAlchemy models. Integrated offline/online run configuration, dynamic environment variables connection overrides, and critical SQLite support with `render_as_batch=True`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Framework**: PyTorch, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.x Async.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Database**: SQLite + aiosqlite as modern development proxy engine.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Data Shapes**: `(batch_size, seq_len=20, input_dim=4)`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Sensors**: Temperature, Humidity, CO2, Light.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
