ion, including FastAPI instantiation, CORS (access for Streamlit), exception handler filters (422, 404, 500), request ID middleware configuration, and health monitoring diagnostics interfaces.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Database Session Router** (`src/db/session.py`): Configured SQLite asynchronous backend with SQLAlchemy 2.x async, get_db session dependency injection helper, and init_db startup hook.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API & Boilerplate Unit Tests** (`tests/api/test_main.py`): Implemented thorough unit tests covering CORS, health checks, exception formatting, and mocked db failures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Unit Testing & Validation** (`tests/`): Pytest suite includes tests for mathematical stability, physical data constraints, and tensor shaping across batches.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture README**: Located in `src/models/README.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-001**: LSTM-VAE Architecture ADR at `docs/architecture/ADR-001-lstm-vae-architecture.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-002**: Synthetic Data Generation ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data-generation.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-003**: Modular Architecture for Easy Phase 1.5 Scaling ADR at `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-phase-1-5-architecture.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture Assessment**: Completed a full architecture assessment, documented in `docs/team/ADRs/ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Database Models** (`src/db/models.py`, `src/db/__init__.py`, `tests/unit/test_db_models.py`): Designed isomorphically standard SQLAlchemy 2.x declarative schemas and a reusable `Base` class mapping. Established validation tests on in-memory SQLite backend demonstrating proper indexing for `tenant_id` and `timestamp`, timezone support, structural safety, nullable fiel