s the updated file: `src/api/main.py`\"}],\"phase\":1},{\"agents\":[{\"agent\":\"code-reviewer\",\"context_from\":[\"backend-engineer\"],\"output_file\":\"src/api/routes/upload.py,src/api/routes/inference.py,src/api/routes/health.py,src/db/seeds.py,alembic/versions/001_initial.py,src/api/main.py\",\"task\":\"Review all the files generated by the `backend-engineer`. \\nYou are responsible for the following:\\n1.  Check for correctness, performance, security, and style.\\n2.  Verify that all requirements from the task description have been met.\\n3.  Ensure that the code is well-documented with type hints and docstrings.\\n4.  Check for proper error handling and database transaction management.\\n5.  Verify that no hardcoded paths or values are used.\\n6.  Ensure that logging is implemented correctly.\\n7.  If any issues are found, you can directly edit the files to fix them.\\n8.  The output of this task are the reviewed and potentially corrected files.\"}],\"phase\":2}]}"},"requestText":"Requesting permission to make tool call","toolConfirmationRequest":{}}}
