2026-06-08 18:46:15,980 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"172","timestampMicros":"1780940775979775","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"d6e70b162b52582466a471ddd5463300","trajectoryId":"d6e70b162b52582466a471ddd5463300","stepIndex":44,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Update AGENT_MEMORY.md","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/AGENT_MEMORY.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":55,"lines":[{"text":"Here is the updated status of the **AI Agronomist** agent memory. I have updated [AGENT_MEMORY.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/AGENT_MEMORY.md) to record the design specifications and base infrastructure built in Week 2, Phase 1.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"### Summary of Memory Updates","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"1. **API & Dashboard Architecture Design**: Documented REST endpoint schemas, rate limiting strategy, and Streamlit page flows in [api_dashboard_design.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/architecture/api_dashboard_design.md).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"2. **Vendor Data Adapters Design**: Standardized abstract interface contracts, standardization constraints for different vendors, and error management strategies in [vendor_adapter_design.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/architecture/vendor_adapter_design.md).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"3. **Pydantic Validation Schemas**: Checked [sensor_data.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/schemas/sensor_data.py) off as complete with detailed validation fields (`SensorReadingCreate`, `SensorReadingResponse`, `UploadRequest`, `UploadResponse`, etc.).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"4. **Machine Learning Inference Improvements**: Registered upgraded capabilities for checkpoint loading, memory configuration, and batch processing inside [inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/inference.py).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"5. **Structured Logging Infrastructure**: Registered telemetry setup including JSON formatter configurations, safety redaction rules, and rotation setups inside [config.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/logging/config.py).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"***","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"### Updated `AGENT_MEMORY.md` File Content","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"```markdown","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"# Agent Memory & Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Project: AI Agronomist (Greenhouse Anomaly Detection)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"**Current Phase**: Phase 2 — API, Dashboard & Vendor Integration","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Completed Tasks (Week 1 & Week 2 Foundations)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **LSTM-VAE Architecture** ([lstm_vae.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/lstm_vae.py)): Implemented with 2 LSTM layers in encoder/decoder and 8-dim latent space. Model includes type hints and docstrings.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Synthetic Data Generator** ([data_generator.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/data_generator.py)): Implemented basic realistic normal greenhouse sensor data with day/night cycles.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Data Utilities** ([data_utils.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/data_utils.py)): Data loading, preprocessing, dataloader creation, and denormalization.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Configuration** ([config.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/config.py)): Hyperparameters for the model, training, and data generation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Training Pipeline** ([training.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/training.py), [train_lstm_vae.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/scripts/train_lstm_vae.py)): Training loops with early stopping, validation metrics, checkpointing, and tensorboard logging fully operational.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API Boilerplate Structure** ([main.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/main.py)): Implemented initial REST API foundation, including FastAPI instantiation, CORS (access for Streamlit), exception handler filters (422, 404, 500), request ID middleware configuration, and health monitoring diagnostics interfaces.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Health Check Endpoints & Router** ([health.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/routes/health.py)): Implemented custom health endpoints `/health` and deep checker `/health/db` utilizing asynchronous query execution, appropriate logger channels, and clean status schemas.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- ✅ **Database Session Router** ([session.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/db/session.py)): Configured SQLite asynchronous backend with SQLAlchemy 2.x async, get_db session dependency injection helper, and init_db startup hook.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API & Boilerplate Unit Tests** ([test_main.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_main.py)): Implemented thorough unit tests covering CORS, health checks, exception formatting, and mocked db failures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API & Boilerplate Unit Tests** ([test_main.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_main.py)): Implemented thorough unit tests covering CORS, the restructured health / health/db contracts, exception formatting, and mocked db failures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- ✅ **Unit Testing & Validation** ([tests](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/)): Pytest suite includes tests for mathematical stability, physical data constraints, and tensor shaping across batches.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture README**: Located in [README.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/README.md).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-001**: LSTM-VAE Architecture ADR at [ADR-001-lstm-vae-architecture.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/architecture/ADR-001-lstm-vae-architecture.md).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-002**: Synthetic Data Generation ADR at [ADR-002-synthetic-data-generation.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data-generation.md).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **ADR-003**: Modular Architecture for Easy Phase 1.5 Scaling ADR at [ADR-003-modular-phase-1-5-architecture.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-phase-1-5-architecture.md).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Architecture Assessment**: Completed a full architecture assessment, documented in [ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Database Models** ([models.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/db/models.py), [\\_\\_init\\_\\_.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/db/__init__.py), [test_db_models.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/unit/test_db_models.py)): Designed isomorphically standard SQLAlchemy 2.x declarative schemas and a reusable `Base` class mapping. Established validation tests on in-memory SQLite backend demonstrating proper indexing for `tenant_id` and `timestamp`, timezone support, structural safety, nullable fields, and default column values.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Alembic Database Migrations Suite** ([alembic.ini](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/alembic.ini), [env.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/db/migrations/env.py), [script.py.mako](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/db/migrations/script.py.mako)): Configured the entire migration facility leveraging local SQLAlchemy models. Integrated offline/online run configuration, dynamic environment variables connection overrides, and critical SQLite support with `render_as_batch=True`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API, Dashboard & Vendor Adapter Designs**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"  - Produced REST API endpoint specifications, rate limiting strategy, and Streamlit page designs in [api_dashboard_design.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/architecture/api_dashboard_design.md).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"  - Outlined data normalization pipelines, error handling per vendor, and future extensibility in [vendor_adapter_design.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/architecture/vendor_adapter_design.md).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **FastAPI Schema Validation** ([sensor_data.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/schemas/sensor_data.py)): Implemented complete, strictly validated Pydantic v2 models covering `SensorReadingCreate`, `SensorReadingResponse`, `UploadRequest`, `UploadResponse`, `InferenceRequest`, and `InferenceResponse`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Vendor Adapter Foundations** ([base.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/vendors/base.py), [csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/vendors/csv_adapter.py) / [csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/csv_adapter.py)): Defined abstract class `DataSourceAdapter` specifying contracts for data reading, validation, and normalization, with concrete implementation for CSV files.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Model Inference Engine Improvements** ([inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/inference.py)): Enhanced `AnomalyDetector` class to handle trained model checkpoints, variable-length input sequences, and real-time inference error propagation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Structured Logger & Error Monitoring** ([config.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/logging/config.py)): Setup structured logging configs using `python-json-logger`, console & rotating file backends, sensitive field redaction, and error logging triggers on API requests.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending / Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ⬜ **Local Dev Environment / Dockerization**: Complete Docker DevOps settings (e.g. docker-compose configuration).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ⬜ **Streamlit Dashboard Implementation**: Develop the front-end user interfaces (`sensor_data.py`, `anomalies.py`, `thresholds.py`, `metrics.py`).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- ⬜ **Multitenant Rate Limiting & API Integration**: Connect endpoint business logic to database, adapters, and model inference with multi-tenant rate limiting and authorization.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Framework**: PyTorch, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.x Async.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Database**: SQLite + aiosqlite as modern development proxy engine.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Data Shapes**: `(batch_size, seq_len=20, input_dim=4)`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Sensors**: Temperature, Humidity, CO2, Light.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"```","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
