2026-06-08 18:46:51,679 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"24","timestampMicros":"1780940811678121","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"5f4da09698aa7935bcb388b10193ff5c","trajectoryId":"5f4da09698aa7935bcb388b10193ff5c","stepIndex":6,"state":"STATE_WAITING_FOR_USER","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"ADR-002 creation","thinkingDelta":"","text":"ADR-002 creation","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md"},"requestText":"Requesting permission to make tool call","toolConfirmationRequest":{}}}
2026-06-08 18:46:51,681 - google.antigravity.hooks.policy - INFO - Policy 'confirm_run_command' approved tool 'edit_file'.
2026-06-08 18:46:51,728 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"25","timestampMicros":"1780940811727713","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"5f4da09698aa7935bcb388b10193ff5c","trajectoryId":"5f4da09698aa7935bcb388b10193ff5c","stepIndex":6,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"ADR-002 creation","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":0,"lines":[{"text":"# ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation for Model Training","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Status**: Proposed","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Date**: 2026-06-08","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Author**: AI Architect","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"The LSTM-VAE model requires a large and diverse dataset for effective training. Real-world sensor data from greenhouses is often scarce, noisy, and may not cover all possible scenarios. To address this, we need a strategy for generating synthetic data that accurately reflects the characteristics of real data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Decision","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"We will implement a **synthetic data generator** using statistical methods and domain-specific knowledge. The generator will create time-series data that mimics the patterns of temperature, humidity, and CO2 levels observed in a real greenhouse, including anomalies and sensor noise.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Rationale","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Data Availability**: Synthetic data generation allows us to create a large dataset for training and testing, reducing our reliance on limited real-world data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Controlled Scenarios**: We can generate data for specific scenarios, such as sensor failures or unusual environmental conditions, to improve the model's robustness.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Cost-Effective**: Generating data is significantly cheaper and faster than collecting and labeling real-world data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Iterative Model Improvement**: As we collect more real data, we can refine the synthetic data generator to produce more realistic data, creating a feedback loop for continuous model improvement.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Consequences","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Data Realism**: The synthetic data may not perfectly capture the complexity and nuances of real-world data, which could lead to a model that performs well on synthetic data but not on real data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Maintenance**: The synthetic data generator will require ongoing maintenance and refinement as we learn more about the data and the model's performance.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
