nfiguration, and batch processing inside [inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/inference.py).","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"5. **Structured Logging Infrastructure**: Registered telemetry setup including JSON formatter configurations, safety redaction rules, and rotation setups inside [config.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/logging/config.py).","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"***","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Updated `AGENT_MEMORY.md` File Content","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"```markdown","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"# Agent Memory & Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"## Project: AI Agronomist (Greenhouse Anomaly Detection)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Current Phase**: Phase 2 — API, Dashboard & Vendor Integration","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"## Completed Tasks (Week 1 & Week 2 Foundations)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **LSTM-VAE Architecture** ([lstm_vae.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/lstm_vae.py)): Implemented with 2 LSTM layers in encoder/decoder and 8-dim latent space. Model includes type hints and docstrings.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Synthetic Data Generator** ([data_generator.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/data_generator.py)): Implemented basic realistic normal greenhouse sensor data with day/night cycles.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Data Utilities** ([data_utils.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/data_utils.py)): Data loading, preprocessing, dataloader creation, and denormalization.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Configuration** ([config.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/config.py)): Hyperparameters for the model, training, and data generation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Training Pipeline** ([training.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/training.py), [train_lstm_vae.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/scripts/train_lstm_vae.py)): Training loops with early stopping, validation metrics, checkpointing, and tensorboard logging fully operational.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API Boilerplate Structure** ([main.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/main.py)): Implemented initial REST API foundation, including FastAPI instantiation, CORS (access for Streamlit), exception handler filters (422, 404, 500), request ID middleware configuration, and health monitoring diagnostics interfaces.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Health Check Endpoints & Router** ([health.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/routes/health.py)): Implemented custom health endpoints `/health` and deep checker `/health/db` utilizing asynchronous query execution, appropriate logger channels, and clean status schemas.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Database Session Router** ([session.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/db/session.py)): Configured SQLite asynchronous backend with SQLAlchemy 2.x async, get_db session dependency injection helper, and init_db startup hook.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **API & Boilerplate Unit Tests** ([test_main.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_main.py)): Implemented thorough unit tests covering CORS, the restructured health / health/db contracts, exception formatting, and mocked db failures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- ✅ **Unit Testing & Validation** ([tests](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/)):