se, and date ranges), persistent session state, and cached DB session logic via `@st.cache_resource`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - [charts.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/dashboard/components/charts.py): Reusable dashboard plotting components (`plot_time_series`, `plot_anomaly_timeline`, and `plot_anomaly_heatmap`) powered by Plotly Express, plus cached DB query utilities.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - [sensor_data.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/dashboard/pages/sensor_data.py): Interactive time-series charts for Temperature, Humidity, CO2, and Light and statistical metrics.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - [anomalies.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/dashboard/pages/anomalies.py): Chronological anomaly timeline plots with interactive tooltips and color-coded severities, hourly/weekly anomaly heatmaps, and a sortable table showing the top 20 anomalies.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - [thresholds.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/dashboard/pages/thresholds.py): Live threshold management slider configuration displaying simulation profiles of recommended, previous, and anticipated adjustments before applying database commits.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - [metrics.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/dashboard/pages/metrics.py): Performance dashboard with sequences parsed, validation summaries, model properties, data quality indicators, and a dataset CSV export utility.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - Package initialization files (`__init__.py`) under `dashboard/`, `dashboard/pages/`, and `dashboard/components/`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending/Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Week 2 Phase 3: Streamlit Dashboard**: Build multi-page Streamlit dashboard integration (`src/dashboard/app.py` and charts components) to display telemetry and anomaly streams.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Week 2 Phase 4: Vendor Abstraction & Priva Stub**: Implement vendor adapters and a Priva-client stub.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Week 2 Phase 5: Integration Tests**: Set up API and end-to-end endpoint tests to reach >80% code coverage.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Week 2 Phase 6: Code Review & Documentation**: Conclude with a detailed week 2 review report, REST api/dashboard ADRs, and deployment verification.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- FastAPI runs asynchronously targeting SQLAlchemy `AsyncSession` with Lifespan hooks.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- Standard CORS mechanisms in local development are configured to accommodate Streamlit (`:8501`) and frontend clients (`:3000`).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"```","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- The Streamlit application leverages `@st.cache_resource` and `@st.cache_data` decorators to optimize database queries and prevent redundant connection pooling across screen refreshes.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Heatmaps and scatter plots leverage interactive Plotly Express structures with customizable tooltip hover payloads.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
