text":"    Expected Canonical Schema columns:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `timestamp`: UTC datetime (datetime64[ns, UTC])","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `temperature`: float64 (Ambient temperature in degrees Celsius, [0.0, 50.0])","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `humidity`: float64 (Relative humidity percentage, [0.0, 100.0])","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `co2`: float64 (CO2 concentration in parts per million (ppm), [0.0, 1000.0])","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - `light`: float64 (Light intensity in lux, [0.0, 2000.0])","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    Error Handling strategy is fully specified:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - Anticipated failures (such as connection timeouts, file-not-found, schema mismatch, etc.)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"      must raise specific, wrapped exceptions (e.g. `DataSourceConnectionError`, `DataReadError`, ","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"      `NormalizationError`, `DataValidationError`) to decouple calling APIs from vendor-specific details.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    def __init__(self, config: Dict[str, Any]):","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"        Initializes the adapter with vendor-specific configuration.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"        Args:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"            config: A dictionary containing configuration parameters such as","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"                    API keys, file paths, or database credentials.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"        \"\"\"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"        self.config = config","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"            conf