/Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/unit/test_csv_adapter.py): Wrote comprehensive unit tests targeting init state, connect failures (missing values, file-not-found), parser errors, custom mappings, types conversions, and physical ranges bounds validation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending/Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Week 2 Phase 4 (Cont.)**: Build Priva client adapter, ensuring alignment with the `DataSourceAdapter` contract.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Week 2 Phase 5: Integration Tests**: Set up API and end-to-end endpoint tests to reach >80% code coverage.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Week 2 Phase 6: Code Review & Documentation**: Conclude with a detailed week 2 review report, REST api/dashboard ADRs, and deployment verification.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- FastAPI runs asynchronously targeting SQLAlchemy `AsyncSession` with Lifespan hooks.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- Standard CORS mechanisms in local development are configured to accommodate Streamlit (`:8501`) and frontend clients (`:3000`).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- The Streamlit application leverages `@st.cache_resource` and `@st.cache_data` decorators to optimize database queries and prevent redundant connection pooling across screen refreshes.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- Heatmaps and scatter plots leverage interactive Plotly Express structures with customizable tooltip hover payloads.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
