agement slider configuration displaying simulation profiles of recommended, previous, and anticipated adjustments before applying database commits.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    - [metrics.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/dashboard/pages/metrics.py): Performance dashboard with sequences parsed, validation summaries, model properties, data quality indicators, and a dataset CSV export utility.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"  - **Week 2 Phase 4: Vendor Abstraction**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    - [base.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/vendors/base.py): Defined standard `DataSourceAdapter` ABC interface with custom vendor exceptions, robust lifecycle orchestration (`get_data`), design compatibility aliases, and fully parameterized static canonical schema validator.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    - [priva_client.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/vendors/priva_client.py): Created the `PrivaClient` concrete adapter class as a realistic stub supporting connect, read, normalize, validate, and Phase 1.5 async scaffolds.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    - [csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/vendors/csv_adapter.py): Implemented the concrete `CSVAdapter` class inheriting from `DataSourceAdapter` with full file validation, custom column mappings, parameterizable `pd.read_csv` support, UTC timezone standardization, numerical coercion mapping, and wrapped exception handling.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    - [__init__.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/vendors/__init__.py): Exposed all concrete and abstract vendor components in standard module interface under a unified sub-package.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    - [test_vendors_base.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/unit/test_vendors_base.py): Wrote comprehensive suite checking ABC instantiation, mock validation, error-to-disconnect resilience flows, timezone-aware UTC compliance, and float/int range checks.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    - [test_csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/unit/test_csv_adapter.py): Wrote comprehensive unit tests targeting init state, connect failures (missing values, file-not-found), parser errors, custom mappings, types conversions, and physical ranges bounds validation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    - [test_csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_csv_adapter.py): Developed a comprehensive unit test suite targeting the vendor-specific CSVAdapter, covering connect/disconnect states, file checking, read behaviors (including mock fallback and corrupt CSV data), timezone normalization, numeric coercion, strict physical bounds, validation, and template-based execution lifecycle.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - [test_priva_stub.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_priva_stub.py): Created comprehensive unit tests for the `PrivaClient` stub, covering constructors, config variations, exception hierarchies, data read, normalization transformations, schema constraint validations, and all Phase 1.5 async scaffolds.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    - [__init__.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/__init__.py): Created package initialization file for the vendor test suite.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending/Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Week 2 Phase 5: Integration Tests**: Set up API and end-to-end endpoint tests to reach >80% code coverage.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Week 2 Phase 6: Code Review & Documentation**: Conclude with a detailed week 2 review report, REST api/dashboard ADRs, and deployment verification.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- FastAPI runs asynchronously targeting SQLAlchemy `AsyncSession` with Lifespan hooks.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- Standard CORS mechanisms in local development are configured to accommodate Streamlit (`:8501`) and frontend clients (`:3000`).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- The Streamlit application leverages `@st.cache_resource` and `@st.cache_data` decorators to optimize database queries and prevent redundant connection pooling across screen refreshes.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- Heatmaps and scatter plots leverage interactive Plotly Express structures with customizable tooltip hover payloads.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
