2026-06-09 10:55:50,550 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"162","timestampMicros":"1780998950550436","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"893b23b93588852d98ef9195715e4552","trajectoryId":"893b23b93588852d98ef9195715e4552","stepIndex":44,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Overwriting ADR-003","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":30,"lines":[{"text":"# ADR-003: Modular Monolith and Service Boundaries","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Status**: Proposed","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Date**: 2026-06-08","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Author**: AI Architect","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"# ADR-003: Modular Architecture for the AI Agronomist Platform","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Date:** 2026-06-09","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Status:** Adopted","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"To ensure the long-term maintainability and scalability of the AI Agronomist platform, we need to establish clear boundaries between different components of the system. This is crucial for a modular monolithic architecture, as it prevents tight coupling and facilitates future migration to microservices.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"The AI Agronomist platform is a complex system that consists of several different components, including a data ingestion pipeline, a machine learning model, and an API. To ensure that the platform is scalable, maintainable, and easy to develop, a modular architecture is required.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Decision","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"We will structure the application into the following distinct modules:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **`src/api`**: Handles all API-related concerns, including routing, request/response models, and authentication.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **`src/models`**: Contains the machine learning models, including the LSTM-VAE, as well as data processing and feature engineering logic.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **`src/db`**: Manages all database interactions, including schema definitions, session management, and CRUD operations.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **`src/config`**: Centralizes all application configuration, such as database connection strings, model hyperparameters, and external API keys.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"## Rationale","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Separation of Concerns**: Each module has a single, well-defined responsibility, which makes the codebase easier to understand, maintain, and test.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Reduced Coupling**: The modules will communicate through well-defined interfaces, which reduces coupling and allows for independent development and testing.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Scalability**: The modular design makes it easier to identify performance bottlenecks and scale individual components as needed.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Future-Proofing**: The clear boundaries between modules will make it easier to extract services into a microservices architecture in the future.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"We will adopt a modular architecture for the AI Agronomist platform, with a clear separation of concerns between the different components of the system. The key modules of the platform will be:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Data Ingestion Module:** This module will be responsible for ingesting sensor data from a variety of sources and normalizing it to a canonical schema.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Machine Learning Module:** This module will be responsible for training and deploying the machine learning model.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **API Module:** This module will provide a RESTful API for interacting with the platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Database Module:** This module will be responsible for storing and managing the data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Consequences","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- **Increased Complexity**: The modular design adds some complexity to the codebase, as it requires careful management of dependencies and interfaces between modules.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- **Potential for Circular Dependencies**: We must be vigilant to avoid circular dependencies between modules, which can lead to a tightly coupled and difficult-to-maintain codebase.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Positive","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Improved Scalability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to scale the platform, as each module can be scaled independently.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Improved Maintainability:** The separation of concerns will make it easier to maintain the platform, as changes to one module will not affect the others.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Improved Developability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to develop the platform, as different teams can work on different modules in parallel.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### Negative","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Increased Complexity:** The modular architecture will add some complexity to the system.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Potential for Performance Overhead:** There may be a small amount of performance overhead associated with the communication between the different modules.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
