_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"This document provides a summary of the current stage, completed accomplishments, pending actions, and technical constraints of the Antigravity Agent (Code Reviewer & Quality Engineer).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Current Phase","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"We are currently executing **Week 2, Phase 4**: implementing and validating the Vendor Abstraction Layer and establishing the Priva API Client Stub for seamless Phase 1.5 multi-source integration.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Completed Tasks","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Abstract Abstraction Design (`src/vendors/base.py`)**: Implemented the `DataSourceAdapter` interface mapping raw inputs to standard, multi-tenant schemas. Integrated custom hierarchical exceptions (`VendorError`, `DataSourceConnectionError`, `DataReadError`, `NormalizationError`, `DataValidationError`) and standard-validated columns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **CSV Adapter Implementation (`src/vendors/csv_adapter.py`)**: Formulated CSV-parsing mechanisms that ingest timezone-naive and timezone-aware timestamps, perform data range bound validations, and output pristine canonical columns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Priva API Client Scaffold (`src/vendors/priva_client.py`)**: Engineered a concrete client stub enabling authentication hook scaffold (`_authenticate`), greenhouse polling (`_list_greenhouses`), and sensor reads (`_get_sensor_data`) with high-fidelity simulated response payloads matching our target sensor structure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Comprehensive Testing Suite (`tests/vendors/`)**: Completed full test automation across happy/unhappy and boundary exception states:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   [test_csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_csv_adapter.py) covers initialization, parsing of missing or invalid columns, non-numeric values, and empty structures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   [test_priva_stub.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_priva_stub.py) validates compliance to the interface, mock fetching, boundary validations, and method contracts.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Architecture & Quality Audit Documentation**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   Produced [code_review_phase4.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/.gemini/antigravity/brain/d2121f0c96402a3ee69a61f1e3ce6be1/code_review_phase4.md) detailing structural and quality assessments for the source files.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   Documented system architecture decisions in:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-001: Vendor Abstraction Layer](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-003: Modular Architecture](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   Generated [week1-review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/review/week1-review.md) summarizing foundational status.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Pending/Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Orchestration Support**: Integrate the newly minted `DataSourceAdapter` implementations directly with the main ingest pipeline and model training orchestration layers.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Dynamic Source Selection**: Allow quick switching between \"csv\" and \"priva\" ingestion based on tenant configuration settings without code modifications.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **OAuth / Real Endpoint Upgrades (Phase 1.5)**: Replace mockup methods in `PrivaClient` with active network endpoints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Canonical Sensor Schema**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `timestamp`: timezone-aware datetime64 formatted in UTC","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `temperature`: float within range [0.0, 50.0] °C","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `humidity`: float within range [0.0, 100.0] %","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `co2`: float within range [0.0, 1000.0] ppm","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `light`: float within range [0.0, 2000.0] lux","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Guardrail Alignment & Architectural Compliance**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   *No Tight Coupling*: Downstream clients consume a unified shape and unified abstract errors, preserving domain separation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   *No Secrets in Code*: The `PrivaClient` retrieves API keys dynamically via injected dictionary configurations, using harmless non-secret placeholders by default.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   *Decisions Documented*: Key design vectors are codified inside the ADR directory structure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   *Validated Ingress*: Boundary violations or NaN representations immediately trigger structured `DataValidationError` exceptions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
