ction":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"            <div class=\"analysis-card\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                <h4>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><path d=\"M11 6a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0z\"/><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8zm8-7a7 7 0 0 0-5.468 11.37C3.242 11.226 4.805 10 8 10s4.757 1.225 5.468 2.37A7 7 0 0 0 8 1z\"/></svg>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    Critical In-Domain Path Evaluation","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                </h4>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                <p>Ensuring 100% correctness of deep learning and machine learning modules is paramount. Our fundamental components have recorded exemplary testing results:</p>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                <ul class=\"highlight-list\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    <li class=\"highlight-item\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <span class=\"highlight-icon\">✓</span>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                            <strong>lstm_vae.py (98.90%)</strong>: Re-parameterization trick and variational layers are heavily audited. Multi-device stochastic operations hold complete numeric and dimensional stability checks.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        </div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    </li>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    <li class=\"highlight-item\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <span class=\"highlight-icon\">✓</span>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                            <strong>training.py (100.00%)</strong>: End-to-end multi-epoch optimizer iterations, learning rate schedulers, and metrics logging workflows have complete test representation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        </div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    </li>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    <li class=\"highlight-item\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <span class=\"highlight-icon\">✓</span>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                            <strong>data_generator.py (96.91%)</strong>: Synthetic sensor generation loops and covariance mapping bounds run tests across multiple mock seasons and custom anomalies.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        </div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    </li>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    <li class=\"highlight-item\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <span class=\"highlight-icon\">✓</span>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                            <strong>checkpoint_manager.py (92.66%)</strong>: Saves and loads model state dictionaries concurrently with mandatory schema components (epoch, loss, configuration details, date).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        </div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    </li>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                </ul>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"            </div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"            <div class=\"analysis-card\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                <h4>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><path d=\"M8 15A7 7 0 1 1 8 1a7 7 0 0 1 0 14zm0 1A8 8 0 1 0 8 0a8 8 0 0 0 0 16z\"/><path d=\"M7.002 11a1 1 0 1 1 2 0 1 1 0 0 1-2 0zM7.1 4.995a.905.905 0 1 1 1.8 0l-.35 3.507a.552.552 0 0 1-1.1 0L7.1 4.995z\"/></svg>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    Outstanding Coverage Observations","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                </h4>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                <p>The few lines leaving uncovered sections are categorized and monitored below:</p>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                <ul class=\"highlight-list\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    <li class=\"highlight-item\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <span class=\"highlight-icon highlight-icon-warn\">!</span>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                            <strong>formatting_hooks.py (58.54%)</strong>: These pre-commit system logic hooks check local formatting and lints. Since they interact with disk-level CLI processes, several branches are stubbed or bypassed in unit testing because they form part of dev environment enforcement rather than inside runtime modules.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        </div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    </li>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                    <li class=\"highlight-item\">","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <span class=\"highlight-icon highlight-icon-warn\">!</span>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                        <div>","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"                            <strong>data_utils.py (83.52%)</strong>: Handles pandas loading fallbacks and directory creation warnings. Paths where files do not