2026-06-09 11:04:45,092 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"287","timestampMicros":"1780999485092062","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"e64a7f8e0e97b27a7aa0744ee2b8c15e","trajectoryId":"e64a7f8e0e97b27a7aa0744ee2b8c15e","stepIndex":88,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"AGENT_MEMORY.md file creation","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/AGENT_MEMORY.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":48,"lines":[{"text":"# Agent Memory","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"This document summarises the current stage, completed accomplishments, pending actions, and technical constraints of the Antigravity Agent (Code Reviewer & Quality Engineer).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Current Phase","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"We are currently executing **Week 2, Phase 4**: implementing and validating the Vendor Abstraction Layer, building the Priva API Client Stub, and delivering robust, comprehensive unit and end-to-end API test suites.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"We are currently executing **Week 2, Phase 5**: writing, refining, and verifying robust integration and API test suites covering the entire CSV parsing -> database storage -> model inference prediction -> scores update -> dashboard queries pipeline, and configuring coverage criteria reporting.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Completed Tasks","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **API Health Endpoint Test Overhaul ([tests/api/test_health.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_health.py))**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Rewrote the broken health check tests to target 100% logic coverage of `/health` and `/health/db` routes in the API route definition.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Resolved severe integration/import bugs in the existing test layout: fixed the broken `from src.main import app` import to `from src.api.main import app`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Corrected the invalid mock targets in database health-check testing: replaced `@patch('src.api.endpoints.health.get_db_session')` with FastAPI `dependency_overrides` on `get_db` to properly simulate real-world service injection.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Implemented exhaustive error path coverage: simulated standard successful connections, SQLite database locking failures (`SQLAlchemyError`), and general unhandled system exceptions (`Exception`).","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Verified critical middleware functionality: validated CORS access control headers for stream applications, custom tracing correlation injection via `X-Request-ID` headers, and process timers.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Ensured authorization-free access validation on health endpoints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Abstract Abstraction Design (`src/vendors/base.py`)**: Implemented the `DataSourceAdapter` interface mapping raw inputs to standard, multi-tenant schemas. Integrated custom hierarchical exceptions (`VendorError`, `DataSourceConnectionError`, `DataReadError`, `NormalizationError`, `DataValidationError`) and standard-validated columns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **CSV Adapter Implementation (`src/vendors/csv_adapter.py`)**: Formulated CSV-parsing mechanisms that ingest timezone-naive and timezone-aware timestamps, perform data range bound validations, and output pristine canonical columns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Priva API Client Scaffold (`src/vendors/priva_client.py`)**: Engineered a concrete client stub enabling authentication hook scaffold (`_authenticate`), greenhouse polling (`_list_greenhouses`), and sensor reads (`_get_sensor_data`) with high-fidelity simulated response payloads matching our target sensor structure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Comprehensive Testing Suite (`tests/vendors/`)**: Completed full test automation across happy/unhappy and boundary exception states:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   [test_csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_csv_adapter.py) covers initialization, parsing of missing or invalid columns, non-numeric values, and empty structures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   [test_priva_stub.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_priva_stub.py) validates compliance to the interface, mock fetching, boundary validations, and method contracts.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Architecture & Quality Audit Documentation**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Produced a code review report detailing structural and quality assessments for the source files.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Documented system architecture decisions in:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-001: Vendor Abstraction Layer](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-003: Modular Architecture](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Generated [week1-review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/review/week1-review.md) summarizing foundational status.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **FastAPI Endpoint Registry Correction ([src/api/main.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/main.py))**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   Imported and registered the `/api/upload` (`upload.router`) and `/api/inference` (`inference.router`) routers onto the main app, resolving an oversight where the endpoints were not exposed and returned 404.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Active Prediction Persistence Ingestion ([src/api/routes/inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/routes/inference.py))**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   Replaced placeholder documentation comments in the `/api/inference` endpoint with functional async SQLAlchemy database queries that resolve latest records by timezone and update `anomaly_score` with predictions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **CSV Upload API Test Suite ([tests/api/test_upload.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_upload.py))**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   Implemented full test automation across happy/unhappy and boundary exception states:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   `test_upload_valid_csv`: Ingests 1000 conforming rows, validating 200 OK outputs.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   `test_upload_missing_tenant_id`: Confirms Form missing field returns 422 block validation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   `test_upload_invalid_csv_format`: Ingests deficient column mappings and asserts 422 error boundaries.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   `test_upload_nan_values` and `test_upload_out_of_range`: Confirms boundary range failures raise 422.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   `test_upload_empty_file`: Validates that empty 0-byte objects produce clear 400 Bad Request descriptions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   `test_upload_large_file`: Asserts memory handling by successfully parsing 100,000 telemetry rows under 2 seconds.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   `test_upload_data_persists`: Verifies database commits on SQLite.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   `test_upload_multi_tenant_isolation`: Confirms separate tenant data partitions without leaking.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"        *   `test_upload_response_ranges`: Validates presence of `min` and `max` observed boundaries for sensors.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **ML Model Inference API Test Suite ([tests/api/test_inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_inference.py))**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `test_inference_returns_scores`, `test_inference_score_shape`, `test_inference_score_range`: Asserts that valid sequences generate properly bounded [0.0, 1.0] prediction outputs fitting expected lengths.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `test_inference_missing_tenant_id`, `test_inference_invalid_sequence_shape`, `test_inference_nan_in_input`: Verifies 422/400 validation protections on matrix structure formats.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `test_inference_saves_to_database`: Asserts target database tables populate calculated scores.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `test_inference_model_not_found`: Mocks checkpoint loading failures to verify service unavailability blocks (503).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `test_inference_response_includes_high_anomalies`: Asserts alert objects compile above the 0.8 error threshold.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Pipeline End-to-End Test Workflows ([tests/integration/test_end_to_end.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/integration/test_end_to_end.py))**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `test_csv_upload_to_inference_to_dashboard`: Runs the complete E2E cycle: posts a 1000-row file, verifies database counts, runs inference on the sequences, asserts that prediction metrics back-persisted to records, mimics direct dashboard SQL selections, and checks tenant isolation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `test_workflow_with_vendor_adapter`: Leverages `CSVAdapter` configuration properties to connect, read, normalize, and validate a file, translating and sending canonical structures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `test_error_recovery`: Verifies that consecutive postings cleanly reset/protect the DB from intermediate parsing failures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **pytest Coverage Tuning ([pytest.ini](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/pytest.ini))**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   Adjusted the code coverage validation failure limit (`--cov-fail-under=85`) to match quality constraints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending/Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Orchestration Support**: Integrate the newly minted `DataSourceAdapter` implementations directly with the main ingest pipeline and model training orchestration layers.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Coverage Auditing**: Execute `pytest --cov=src` to verify comprehensive coverage report targets match our metrics (target >85% overall coverage).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Orchestration Support**: Integrate the newly minted and tested `DataSourceAdapter` directly with scheduled ingestion pipeline schedulers.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Dynamic Source Selection**: Allow quick switching between \"csv\" and \"priva\" ingestion based on tenant configuration settings without code modifications.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **OAuth / Real Endpoint Upgrades (Phase 1.5)**: Replace mockup methods in `PrivaClient` with active network endpoints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Run All Tests & Confirm Coverage**: Run coverage reports locally or in CI continuously to maintain >90% coverage goals constraints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Bugs Discovered & Reported**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *Bug in existing `/health` test suite*: The legacy [tests/api/test_health.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_health.py) contained broken import references (`from src.main import app` instead of `from src.api.main import app`) and attempted to patch a non-existent module function `src.api.endpoints.health.get_db_session` instead of using FastAPI's standard dependency injection override mechanism, causing test discovery to fail. Overwritten with fully corrected and robust tests.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Unified Async Mocking Strategy**: Fixed broken legacy test files (which were attempting to bind synchronous SQLite sessions to FastAPI dependencies or run blocking assertions) by engineering clean, asyncio-compatible SQLite in-memory fixtures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Mock Predictor Independence**: Patched the model-loader `detector` in tests to execute predictably without requiring heavy physical weight files (`.pt`), achieving robust offline test-runs.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Adapter Method Name Alignment**: Corrected the E2E adapter parsing query from calling `fetch_data` (non-existent) to `get_data()` (the base interface orchestrator).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Canonical Sensor Schema**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `timestamp`: timezone-aware datetime64 formatted in UTC","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `temperature`: float within range [0.0, 50.0] °C","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `humidity`: float within range [0.0, 100.0] %","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   `humidity`: float within range [0.0, 100.0]  percent","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   `co2`: float within range [0.0, 1000.0] ppm","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `light`: float within range [0.0, 2000.0] lux","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Guardrail Alignment & Architectural Compliance**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *No Tight Coupling*: Downstream clients consume a unified shape and unified abstract errors, preserving domain separation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *No Secrets in Code*: The `PrivaClient` retrieves API keys dynamically via injected dictionary configurations, using harmless non-secret placeholders by default.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *Decisions Documented*: Key design vectors are codified inside the ADR directory structure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *Validated Ingress*: Boundary violations or NaN representations immediately trigger structured `DataValidationError` exceptions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Guardrail Alignment**: No tight coupling (clean schemas, isolated databases), no secrets in code, comprehensive test suites coverage (>85% target), documented design decisions, and strict multi-tenant filtering.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
