VAE spec (locked — do not change without ADR)\nLSTMVAE(input_dim=4, hidden_dims=[64,32], latent_dim=8, seq_len=20, beta=0.1, dropout=0.2)\nLoss: MSE(x, x_recon) + beta * KL(N(μ,σ²) || N(0,I))\nLatent: z = μ + σ ⊙ ε, ε ~ N(0,I)\n\n## Sensor ranges (physical units)\n- Temperature: 20–30°C\n- Humidity: 50–80%\n- CO2: 300–500 ppm\n- Light: 0–1000 lux\n\n## STOP WORK\n- Checkpoint without: epoch, loss, accuracy, timestamp, model_config\n- NaN/Inf in model outputs with no detection\n- Training loop with no early stopping\n- Hard-coded sensor ranges (must reference src/config.py)\n\n## WARN\n- Beta > 1.0 (risk of posterior collapse)\n- Dropout > 0.5 (too aggressive)\n- Learning rate > 1e-2 (unstable)\n\n### ACTIVE SKILL: CODE REVIEW CHECKLIST\n# Code Review Skill\nskill_id: \"code-review\"\nname: \"Code Review\"\ndescription: \"Capability to review code for quality, architecture, and best practices\"\n\napplies_to:\n  - \"backend-engineer\"\n  - \"ml-engineer\"\n  - \"devops-lead\"\n  - \"architect\"\n\nchecklist:\n  quality:\n    - \"Code follows project style guide\"\n    - \"Proper error handling\"\n    - \"No code duplication\"\n    - \"Proper logging\"\n\n  testing:\n    - \"Tests provided\"\n    - \"Test coverage >80%\"\n    - \"Edge cases handled\"\n    - \"All tests passing\"\n\n  documentation:\n    - \"Docstrings complete\"\n    - \"Type hints present\"\n    - \"README updated\"\n    - \"Examples provided\"\n\n  architecture:\n    - \"No tight coupling\"\n    - \"Components independent\"\n    - \"Scalable design\"\n    - \"Extensible for Phase 1.5\"\n\noutput_format:\n  - \"✅ Passes [category]\"\n  - \"⚠️  Warning: [issue]\"\n  - \"🛑 Blocker: [issue]\"\n  - \"📝 Recommendation: [suggestion]\"\n\n### ACTIVE SKILL: AUTOMATED TESTING GATE\n# Automated Testing Skill\nskill_id: \"automated-testing\"\nname: \"Automated Testing\"\ndescription: \"Capability to implement robust unit and integration tests and verify coverage gates\"\n\napplies_to:\n  - \"qa-engineer\"\n  - 