2026-06-09 14:50:57,538 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"26","timestampMicros":"1781013057537652","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"8f5f46ce496d34fccd7882e671b45cbe","trajectoryId":"8f5f46ce496d34fccd7882e671b45cbe","stepIndex":6,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"ADR-001 creation","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-modular-architecture.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":0,"lines":[{"text":"# ADR-001: Modular Architecture","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Status","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Proposed","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"The AI Agronomist platform is a complex system with multiple components, including a frontend, a backend, and a machine learning pipeline. To ensure the long-term maintainability and scalability of the platform, it is important to adopt a modular architecture that promotes loose coupling and high cohesion.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Decision","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"We will adopt a modular architecture based on the following principles:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Separation of Concerns:** Each module should have a single, well-defined responsibility.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Loose Coupling:** Modules should be independent of each other and should communicate through well-defined interfaces.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **High Cohesion:** The elements within a module should be closely related and should work together to achieve a common goal.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Consequences","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"The adoption of a modular architecture will have the following consequences:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Improved Maintainability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to maintain and update the platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Improved Scalability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to scale the platform to meet the needs of a growing user base.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Improved Testability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to test the individual components of the platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"}]}]}}}
