2026-06-09 14:51:13,439 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"43","timestampMicros":"1781013073437588","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"8f5f46ce496d34fccd7882e671b45cbe","trajectoryId":"8f5f46ce496d34fccd7882e671b45cbe","stepIndex":12,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"ADR-003 creation","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":30,"lines":[{"text":"# ADR-003: Modular Architecture for the AI Agronomist Platform","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Date:** 2026-06-09","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Status:** Adopted","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"# ADR-003: Modular Architecture","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Status","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Proposed","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"The AI Agronomist platform is a complex system that consists of several different components, including a data ingestion pipeline, a machine learning model, and an API. To ensure that the platform is scalable, maintainable, and easy to develop, a modular architecture is required.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"The AI Agronomist platform is a complex system with multiple components, including a frontend, a backend, and a machine learning pipeline. To ensure the long-term maintainability and scalability of the platform, it is important to adopt a modular architecture that promotes loose coupling and high cohesion.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Decision","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"We will adopt a modular architecture for the AI Agronomist platform, with a clear separation of concerns between the different components of the system. The key modules of the platform will be:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Data Ingestion Module:** This module will be responsible for ingesting sensor data from a variety of sources and normalizing it to a canonical schema.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Machine Learning Module:** This module will be responsible for training and deploying the machine learning model.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **API Module:** This module will provide a RESTful API for interacting with the platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Database Module:** This module will be responsible for storing and managing the data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"We will adopt a modular architecture based on the following principles:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Separation of Concerns:** Each module should have a single, well-defined responsibility.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Loose Coupling:** Modules should be independent of each other and should communicate through well-defined interfaces.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **High Cohesion:** The elements within a module should be closely related and should work together to achieve a common goal.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Consequences","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"### Positive","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Improved Scalability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to scale the platform, as each module can be scaled independently.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Improved Maintainability:** The separation of concerns will make it easier to maintain the platform, as changes to one module will not affect the others.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Improved Developability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to develop the platform, as different teams can work on different modules in parallel.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Negative","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Increased Complexity:** The modular architecture will add some complexity to the system.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Potential for Performance Overhead:** There may be a small amount of performance overhead associated with the communication between the different modules.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"The adoption of a modular architecture will have the following consequences:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Improved Maintainability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to maintain and update the platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Improved Scalability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to scale the platform to meet the needs of a growing user base.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Improved Testability:** The modular architecture will make it easier to test the individual components of the platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
