straction Design (`src/vendors/base.py`)**: Implemented the `DataSourceAdapter` interface mapping raw inputs to standard, multi-tenant schemas. Integrated custom hierarchical exceptions (`VendorError`, `DataSourceConnectionError`, `DataReadError`, `NormalizationError`, `DataValidationError`) and standard-validated columns.\n*   **CSV Adapter Implementation (`src/vendors/csv_adapter.py`)**: Formulated CSV-parsing mechanisms that ingest timezone-naive and timezone-aware timestamps, perform data range bound validations, and output pristine canonical columns.\n*   **Priva API Client Scaffold (`src/vendors/priva_client.py`)**: Engineered a concrete client stub enabling authentication hook scaffold (`_authenticate`), greenhouse polling (`_list_greenhouses`), and sensor reads (`_get_sensor_data`) with high-fidelity simulated response payloads matching our target sensor structure.\n*   **Comprehensive Testing Suite (`tests/vendors/`)**: Completed full test automation across happy/unhappy and boundary exception states:\n    *   [test_csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_csv_adapter.py) covers initialization, parsing of missing or invalid columns, non-numeric values, and empty structures.\n    *   [test_priva_stub.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_priva_stub.py) validates compliance to the interface, mock fetching, boundary validations, and method contracts.\n*   **Architecture & Quality Audit Documentation**:\n    *   Produced a code review report detailing structural and quality assessments for the source files.\n    *   Documented system architecture decisions in:\n        *   [ADR-001: Vendor Abstraction Layer](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md)\n        *   [ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md)\n        *   [ADR-003: Modular Architecture](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md)\n    *   Generated [week1-review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/review/week1-review.md) summarizing foundational status.\n\n## Pending/Next Steps\n*   **Orchestration Support**: Integrate the newly minted `DataSourceAdapter` implementations directly with the main ingest pipeline and model training orchestration layers.\n*   **Dynamic Source Selection**: Allow quick switching between \"csv\" and \"priva\" ingestion based on tenant configuration settings without code modifications.\n*   **OAuth / Real Endpoint Upgrades (Phase 1.5)**: Replace mockup methods in `PrivaClient` with active network endpoints.\n*   **Run All Tests & Confirm Coverage**: Run coverage reports locally or in CI continuously to maintain >90% coverage goals constraints.\n\n## Technical Notes\n*   **Bugs Discovered & Reported**:\n    *   *Bug in existing `/health` test suite*: The legacy [tests/api/test_health.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_health.py) contained broken import references (`from src.main import app` instead of `from src.api.main import app`) and attempted to patch a non-existent module function `src.api.endpoints.health.get_db_session` instead of using FastAPI's standard dependency injection override mechanism, causing test discovery to fail. Overwritten with fully corrected and robust tests.\n*   **Canonical Sensor Schema**:\n    *   `timestamp`: timezone-aware datetime64 formatted in UTC\n    *   `temperature`: float within range [0.0, 50.0] °C\n    *   `humidity`: float within range [0.0, 100.0] %\n    *   `co2`: float within range [0.0, 1000.0] ppm\n    *   `light`: float within range [0.0, 2000.0] lux\n*   **Guardrail Alignment & Architectural Compliance**:\n    *   *No Tight Coupling*: Downstream clients consume a unified shape and unified abstract errors, preserving domain separation.\n    *   *No Secrets in Code*: The `PrivaClient` retrieves API keys dynamically via injected dictionary configurations, using harmless non-secret placeholders by default.\n    *   *Decisions Documented*: Key design vectors are codified inside the ADR directory structure.\n    *   *Validated Ingress*: Boundary violations or NaN representations immediately trigger structured `DataValidationError` exceptions.\n### Task completed via Antigravity\n**Task:** Continue Week 2 Phase 5 - Write integration tests for complete API workflow and coverage reporting.\n\n**Built:**\n- [x] coverage_report.html\n\n**Task:** Review the FastAPI route logic in `src/api/routes/inference.py` and `src/api/routes/upload.py` for robustness, error handling, and memory management.\n\n**Built:**\n- [x] [be_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/be_review.md)\n\n\n\nHere is the new execution result:\n\nTask: Review the latest changes made for data ingestion and anomaly inference. \nSpecifically, review the FastApi inference routes (src/api/routes/inference.py), upload routes (src/api/routes/upload.py), and the new Streamlit dashboard page (src/dashboard/pages/5_upload_operations.py).\n\n- backend-engineer: Review the FastAPI route logic for robustness, error handling, and potential memory leaks during file uploads. Output findings to `be_review.md`.\n- ml-engineer: Review the anomaly detection preprocessing, sequence parsing, and tensor scaling implemented in `run_inference_from_csv`. Output findings to `ml_review.md`.\n- tech-lead: Review the Streamlit UI `5_upload_operations.py` for UX, structural stability, and API integrations. Output findings to `fe_review.md`.\n- code-reviewer: Consolidate the findings from backend-engineer, ml-engineer, and tech-lead into a final executive summary. Output the final summary to `final_review_report.md`.\nBuilt files:\n- [x] be_review.md\n- [x] ml_review.md\n- [x] fe_review.md\n- [x] final_review_report.md\nFailed files:\n\n\nReturn the updated AGENT_MEMORY.md file 