egration/import bugs in the existing test layout: fixed the broken `from src.main import app` import to `from src.api.main import app`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   Corrected the invalid mock targets in database health-check testing: replaced `@patch('src.api.endpoints.health.get_db_session')` with FastAPI `dependency_overrides` on `get_db` to properly simulate real-world service injection.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   Implemented exhaustive error path coverage: simulated standard successful connections, SQLite database locking failures (`SQLAlchemyError`), and general unhandled system exceptions (`Exception`).","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   Verified critical middleware functionality: validated CORS access control headers for stream applications, custom tracing correlation injection via `X-Request-ID` headers, and process timers.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   Ensured authorization-free access validation on health endpoints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Abstract Abstraction Design (`src/vendors/base.py`)**: Implemented the `DataSourceAdapter` interface mapping raw inputs to standard, multi-tenant schemas. Integrated custom hierarchical exceptions (`VendorError`, `DataSourceConnectionError`, `DataReadError`, `NormalizationError`, `DataValidationError`) and standard-validated columns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **CSV Adapter Implementation (`src/vendors/csv_adapter.py`)**: Formulated CSV-parsing mechanisms that ingest timezone-naive and timezone-aware timestamps, perform data range bound validations, and output pristine canonical columns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Priva API Client Scaffold (`src/vendors/priva_client.py`)**: Engineered a concrete client stub enabling authentication hook scaffold (`_authenticate`), greenhouse polling (`_list_greenhouses`), and sensor reads (`_get_sensor_data`) with high-fidelity simulated response payloads matching our target sensor structure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Comprehensive Testing Suite (`tests/vendors/`)**: Completed full test automation across happy/unhappy and boundary exception states:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   [test_csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_csv_adapter.py) covers initialization, parsing of missing or invalid columns, non-numeric values, and empty structures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   [test_priva_stub.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_priva_stub.py) validates compliance to the interface, mock fetching, boundary validations, and method contracts.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Architecture & Quality Audit Documentation**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   Produced a code review report detailing structural and quality assessments for the source files.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   Documented system architecture decisions in:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-001: Vendor Abstraction Layer](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-003: Modular Architecture](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   Generated [week1-review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/review/week1-review.md) summarizing foundational status.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **API Workflow Integration & Codebase Robustness Reviews (Phase 5)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   Developed and generated complete API workflow integration tests with coverage tracking in [coverage_report.html](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/coverage_report.html).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   **Backend Review ([be_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/be_review.md))**: Evaluated the FastAPI endpoints in and identified tight post-processing coupling, unbounded model caching potential leaks, database race conditions on anomalies storage, and full-load memory footprint concerns in file uploads.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   **ML Process Review ([ml_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/ml_review.md))**: Analyzed anomaly detection preprocessing, sequence parsing, and tensor scaling implemented in `run_inference_from_csv`. Highlighted brittle magic-number reliance for score thresholding, missing timezone enforcement, and scalability bottlenecks with large file processing.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   **Frontend UI Review ([fe_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/fe_review.md))**: Examined the Streamlit dashboard [5_upload_operations.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/dashboard/pages/5_upload_operations.py). Identified synchronous long-running execution locks, absent file schema validations, and hardcoded UI thresholds.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   **Unified Quality Audit Synthesis ([final_review_report.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/final_review_report.md))**: Consolidated the reviews into an executive report with action plans addressing structural violations and scalability patterns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Pending/Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Orchestration Support**: Integrate the newly minted `DataSourceAdapter` implementations directly with the main ingest pipeline and model training orchestration layers.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Extract ML Post-processing Logic**: Move data preparation, scaling, and thresholding steps from FastAPI route endpoints (`src/api/routes/inference.py`) to an appropriate service or integration module to ensure loose coupling.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Implement Cache Eviction / Safe Caching**: Introduce size limit constraints or an eviction strategy on the ML model loader (e.g., standard `functools.lru_cache` or custom eviction) to prevent growth leaks.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Streamlined Data Handling**: Refactor in-memory parsing chunks during model inference loads and file uploads to generator-based streams to support massive CSV files without out-of-memory crashes.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Asynchronous Model Training (UI/UX)**: Refactor long-running model training request hooks in Streamlit from synchronous locks to task/asynchronous queues.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Database Lock & Race Mitigation**: Integrate transactional state validations or retry blocks when writing inferred anomalous metrics concurrently.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Integration Support**: Integrate the `DataSourceAdapter` implementations directly with the main ingest pipeline and model training orchestration layers.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Dynamic Source Selection**: Allow quick switching between \"csv\" and \"priva\" ingestion based on tenant configuration settings without code modifications.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **OAuth / Real Endpoint Upgrades (Phase 1.5)**: Replace mockup methods in `PrivaClient` with active network endpoints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Run All Tests & Confirm Coverage**: Run coverage reports locally or in CI continuously to maintain >90% coverage goals constraints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Bugs Discovered & Reported**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *Bug in existing `/health` test suite*: The legacy [tests/api/test_health.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_health.py) contained broken import references (`from src.main import app` instead of `from src.api.main import app`) and attempted to patch a non-existent module function `src.api.endpoints.health.get_db_session` instead of using FastAPI's standard dependency injection override mechanism, causing test discovery to fail. Overwritten with fully corrected and robust tests.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Bugs & Optimization Discovered**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   *Unbounded Caching memory leak*: Found in FastAPI model cache implementations; currently loads model states into memory indefinitively without an eviction strategy.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   *Lock Vulnerability*: Database score serialization is prone to concurrency lock conflicts or duplicate timestamp-key overlaps during parallel requests.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   *Brittle/Hardcoded Scales*: Detection parameters and scaling matrices are tightly bound to magic coefficients instead of configuration/metadata sources.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"*   **Canonical Sensor Schema**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `timestamp`: timezone-aware datetime64 formatted in UTC","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `temperature`: float within range [0.0, 50.0] °C","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `humidity`: float within range [0.0, 100.0] %","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `co2`: float within range [0.0, 1000.0] ppm","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `light`: float within range [0.0, 2000.0] lux","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Guardrail Alignment & Architectural Compliance**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   *No Tight Coupling*: Downstream clients consume a unified shape and unified abstract errors, preserving domain separation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *No Tight Coupling*: Downstream clients consume a unified shape and unified abstract errors, preserving domain separation. Let's fix the FastAPI route coupling next.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    *   *No Secrets in Code*: The `PrivaClient` retrieves API keys dynamically via injected dictionary configurations, using harmless non-secret placeholders by default.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   *Decisions Documented*: Key design vectors are codified inside the ADR directory structure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   *Validated Ingress*: Boundary violations or NaN representations immediately trigger structured `DataValidationError` exceptions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"### Task completed via Antigravity","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Task:** Continue Week 2 Phase 5 - Write integration tests for complete API workflow and coverage reporting.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Built:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- [x] coverage_report.html","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Task:** Review the FastAPI route logic in `src/api/routes/inference.py` and `src/api/routes/upload.py` for robustness, error handling, and memory management.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Built:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- [x] [be_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/be_review.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
