on":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `co2`: float within range [0.0, 1000.0] ppm","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   `light`: float within range [0.0, 2000.0] lux","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"*   **Guardrail Alignment & Architectural Compliance**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   *No Tight Coupling*: Downstream clients consume a unified shape and unified abstract errors, preserving domain separation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   *No Secrets in Code*: The `PrivaClient` retrieves API keys dynamically via injected dictionary configurations, using harmless non-secret placeholders by default.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   *Decisions Documented*: Key design vectors are codified inside the ADR directory structure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"    *   *Validated Ingress*: Boundary violations or NaN representations immediately trigger structured `DataValidationError` exceptions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"### Task completed via Antigravity","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"**Task:** Continue Week 2 Phase 5 - Write integration tests for complete API workflow and coverage reporting.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"**Built:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- [x] coverage_report.html","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"**Task:** Review the FastAPI route logic in `src/api/routes/inference.py` and `src/api/routes/upload.py` for robustness, error handling, and memory management.","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"**Built:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"- [x] [be_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/be_review.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"### Task completed via Antigravity","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"**Task: