odifications. After carefully examining lines 20-94, I've confirmed that the `@lru_cache` for the detector loading should be updated here. No new issues appear.\n\n\n**Integrating API Endpoint Updates**\n\nI'm now integrating the `get_cached_detector` function within the `/api/inference` endpoint to address instantiation of the `AnomalyDetector` class. This aligns with the overall caching strategy and ensures consistent memory management. I'm focusing on ensuring proper import statements and dependency injection for a smooth integration of the cache with this existing endpoint.\n\n\n","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"**Integrating API Endpoint Updates**\n\nI'm now integrating the `get_cached_detector` function within the `/api/inference` endpoint to address instantiation of the `AnomalyDetector` class. This aligns with the overall caching strategy and ensures consistent memory management. I'm focusing on ensuring proper import statements and dependency injection for a smooth integration of the cache with this existing endpoint.\n\n\n","text":""}}
