inference.py#L220-L244)**\n* **Implementation Details**: Added an integration test specifically targeting the newly modified `/api/inference/upload` flow, confirming that chunked DataFrame uploading, validation bounds checking, and sliding-window timestamp mappings are functional and work exactly as expected.\n\n### 5. Memory Log & Document Retention\n* **Paths Updated**: **[AGENT_MEMORY.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/AGENT_MEMORY.md)** and **[backend_engineer_changes.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/backend_engineer_changes.md)**. Both documents are fully updated in the root directory to log and explain our architectural accomplishments.\n\nAll universal and specific guardrails (such as maintaining complete multi-tenant tenant isolation, preserving decoupled layers, logging, and avoiding hardcoded secrets or passwords) have been fully met. Please let me know if you would like to run any further verification!"}}
