2026-06-09 15:08:04,827 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"33","timestampMicros":"1781014084827462","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"d1249288d6b7ecc64a608a0df44e5673","trajectoryId":"d1249288d6b7ecc64a608a0df44e5673","stepIndex":10,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Create ADR-002","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":26,"lines":[{"text":"# ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation for Testing and Development","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Date:** 2026-06-09","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Status:** Adopted","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"# ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation for Model Pre-Training","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Date**: 2026-06-09","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Status**: Proposed","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Context","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"The AI Agronomist platform requires a reliable and consistent source of data for testing and development purposes. Real-world sensor data can be difficult to obtain, and it may not always be suitable for testing, as it may not contain the specific edge cases or error conditions that need to be tested.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"The LSTM-VAE model requires a large and diverse dataset for effective training. In the early stages of the project, real-world data may be scarce or not representative of all possible scenarios. To address this, we need a strategy for generating synthetic data that can be used to pre-train the model and ensure its robustness.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Decision","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"We will implement a synthetic data generator that can create realistic and representative sensor data for testing and development purposes. This generator will be able to produce data that conforms to the canonical data schema, and it will be configurable to allow for the generation of a wide range of scenarios, including both \"happy path\" and error conditions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"We will implement a synthetic data generator (`src/models/synthetic_data.py`) with the following capabilities:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1.  **Baseline Generation**: Generate \"normal\" sensor readings based on configurable sinusoidal patterns, representing typical diurnal and seasonal cycles.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2.  **Anomaly Injection**: Introduce various types of anomalies into the baseline data, including spikes, drops, and flatlines, to simulate equipment malfunctions or other unusual events.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3.  **Configurability**: The data generator will be highly configurable, allowing us to control the characteristics of the generated data (e.g., noise levels, anomaly frequency, and magnitude).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"## Consequences","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"### Positive","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Improved Testability:** The synthetic data generator will make it easier to test the data ingestion pipeline, as it will provide a reliable and consistent source of data.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Reduced Reliance on Real Data:** The use of synthetic data will reduce our reliance on real-world sensor data, which can be difficult and expensive to obtain.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Faster Development Cycles:** The ability to quickly and easily generate data for testing will help to speed up the development process.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Improved Code Quality:** The ability to test a wide range of scenarios will help to improve the quality of the code.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Negative","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Increased Complexity:** The implementation of a synthetic data generator will add some complexity to the system.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Maintenance Overhead:** The synthetic data generator will need to be maintained and updated as the platform evolves.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Pros**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Enables model training before sufficient real-world data is available.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Improves model robustness by exposing it to a wide range of normal and anomalous conditions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Facilitates testing and validation of the anomaly detection system.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"**Cons**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Synthetic data may not perfectly capture the complexities and nuances of real-world data, potentially leading to a \"sim-to-real\" gap.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- The quality of the synthetic data is highly dependent on the accuracy of the underlying generation models.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
