2026-06-09 15:08:33,277 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"53","timestampMicros":"1781014113276996","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"d1249288d6b7ecc64a608a0df44e5673","trajectoryId":"d1249288d6b7ecc64a608a0df44e5673","stepIndex":16,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Update agent memory","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/AGENT_MEMORY.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":82,"lines":[{"text":"# Agent Memory","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"This document summarises the current stage, completed accomplishments, pending actions, and technical constraints of the Antigravity Agent (Code Reviewer & Quality Engineer).","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"## Current Phase","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"We are currently executing **Week 2, Phase 4**: implementing and validating the Vendor Abstraction Layer, building the Priva API Client Stub, and delivering robust, comprehensive unit and end-to-end API test suites.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"## Completed Tasks","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **API Health Endpoint Test Overhaul ([tests/api/test_health.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_health.py))**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Rewrote the broken health check tests to target 100% logic coverage of `/health` and `/health/db` routes in the API route definition.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Resolved severe integration/import bugs in the existing test layout: fixed the broken `from src.main import app` import to `from src.api.main import app`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Corrected the invalid mock targets in database health-check testing: replaced `@patch('src.api.endpoints.health.get_db_session')` with FastAPI `dependency_overrides` on `get_db` to properly simulate real-world service injection.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Implemented exhaustive error path coverage: simulated standard successful connections, SQLite database locking failures (`SQLAlchemyError`), and general unhandled system exceptions (`Exception`).","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Verified critical middleware functionality: validated CORS access control headers for stream applications, custom tracing correlation injection via `X-Request-ID` headers, and process timers.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Ensured authorization-free access validation on health endpoints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Abstract Abstraction Design (`src/vendors/base.py`)**: Implemented the `DataSourceAdapter` interface mapping raw inputs to standard, multi-tenant schemas. Integrated custom hierarchical exceptions (`VendorError`, `DataSourceConnectionError`, `DataReadError`, `NormalizationError`, `DataValidationError`) and standard-validated columns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **CSV Adapter Implementation (`src/vendors/csv_adapter.py`)**: Formulated CSV-parsing mechanisms that ingest timezone-naive and timezone-aware timestamps, perform data range bound validations, and output pristine canonical columns.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Priva API Client Scaffold (`src/vendors/priva_client.py`)**: Engineered a concrete client stub enabling authentication hook scaffold (`_authenticate`), greenhouse polling (`_list_greenhouses`), and sensor reads (`_get_sensor_data`) with high-fidelity simulated response payloads matching our target sensor structure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Comprehensive Testing Suite (`tests/vendors/`)**: Completed full test automation across happy/unhappy and boundary exception states:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   [test_csv_adapter.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_csv_adapter.py) covers initialization, parsing of missing or invalid columns, non-numeric values, and empty structures.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   [test_priva_stub.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/vendors/test_priva_stub.py) validates compliance to the interface, mock fetching, boundary validations, and method contracts.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Architecture & Quality Audit Documentation**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Produced a code review report detailing structural and quality assessments for the source files.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Documented system architecture decisions in:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-001: Vendor Abstraction Layer](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-002: Synthetic Data Generation](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"        *   [ADR-003: Modular Architecture](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Generated [week1-review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/review/week1-review.md) summarizing foundational status.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Decoupled Post-Processing Logic**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Created `src/models/postprocessing.py` to extract post-processing logic (timestamp mapping, clipping, extracting high anomalies) out of `src/api/routes/inference.py`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Updated `src/config.py` to include `ANOMALY_THRESHOLD = 0.8` and `ANOMALY_SCALING_FACTOR = 2.0`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   Updated `src/api/routes/inference.py` to use these decoupled functions and config values.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"## Pending/Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Orchestration Support**: Integrate the newly minted `DataSourceAdapter` implementations directly with the main ingest pipeline and model training orchestration layers.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Dynamic Source Selection**: Allow quick switching between \"csv\" and \"priva\" ingestion based on tenant configuration settings without code modifications.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **OAuth / Real Endpoint Upgrades (Phase 1.5)**: Replace mockup methods in `PrivaClient` with active network endpoints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Run All Tests & Confirm Coverage**: Run coverage reports locally or in CI continuously to maintain >90% coverage goals constraints.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Bugs Discovered & Reported**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *Bug in existing `/health` test suite*: The legacy [tests/api/test_health.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_health.py) contained broken import references (`from src.main import app` instead of `from src.api.main import app`) and attempted to patch a non-existent module function `src.api.endpoints.health.get_db_session` instead of using FastAPI's standard dependency injection override mechanism, causing test discovery to fail. Overwritten with fully corrected and robust tests.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Canonical Sensor Schema**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   `timestamp`: timezone-aware datetime64 formatted in UTC","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   `temperature`: float within range [0.0, 50.0] °C","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   `humidity`: float within range [0.0, 100.0] %","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   `co2`: float within range [0.0, 1000.0] ppm","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   `light`: float within range [0.0, 2000.0] lux","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"*   **Guardrail Alignment & Architectural Compliance**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *No Tight Coupling*: Downstream clients consume a unified shape and unified abstract errors, preserving domain separation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *No Secrets in Code*: The `PrivaClient` retrieves API keys dynamically via injected dictionary configurations, using harmless non-secret placeholders by default.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *Decisions Documented*: Key design vectors are codified inside the ADR directory structure.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"    *   *Validated Ingress*: Boundary violations or NaN representations immediately trigger structured `DataValidationError` exceptions.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Task completed via Antigravity","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Task:** Continue Week 2 Phase 5 - Write integration tests for complete API workflow and coverage reporting.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Built:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- [x] coverage_report.html","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Task:** Review the FastAPI route logic in `src/api/routes/inference.py` and `src/api/routes/upload.py` for robustness, error handling, and memory management.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Built:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- [x] [be_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/be_review.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Task completed via Antigravity","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Task:** Review the latest changes made for data ingestion and anomaly inference.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Built:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- [x] serve as baseline audits ([be_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/be_review.md), [ml_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/ml_review.md), [fe_review.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/fe_review.md), [final_review_report.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/final_review_report.md))","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Task completed via Antigravity","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Task:** Backend memory-safe stream optimization, sliding-window overlap tracking, and model caching:","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"1. Refactor `/api/inference/upload` in `src/api/routes/inference.py` to stream uploads and parse via chunked DataFrames (chunksize=5000) to prevent memory exhaustion.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"2. Maintain sliding-window overlap (`prev_overlap_df` matching `seq_len - 1`) to preserve robust continuity across chunk boundaries without losing border sequences.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"3. Map sequence endpoints back to original global timestamp indices precisely to achieve robust timestamp alignment in `/api/inference/upload`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"4. Implement a thread-safe, bounded LRU cache (`@lru_cache(maxsize=16)`) in `src/api/routes/inference.py` to cache `AnomalyDetector` instances, preventing unbounded model memory leaks.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"5. Add rigorous integration unit tests in `tests/api/test_inference.py` to cover chunked DataFrame csv loading and validation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"**Built:**","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- [x] Memory-safe, chunked sequence mapping in [src/api/routes/inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/routes/inference.py)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- [x] Thread-safe LRU caching in [src/api/routes/inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/routes/inference.py)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"- [x] Integration testing coverage in [tests/api/test_inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/tests/api/test_inference.py)","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"This document serves as a record of the agent's past actions and key findings.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Session: 2026-06-09","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### Objective","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Perform a security, quality, and guardrails audit of the AI Agronomist platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### Actions Taken","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"1.  Reviewed code changes from the ML Engineer, Backend Engineer, and Tech Lead.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"2.  Created ADRs for the architecture, synthetic data, and modular architecture.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"3.  Generated a final review report with a summary of findings and action items.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### Key Findings","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"-   **Security**: High-risk raw SQL queries were identified.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"-   **Correctness**: Missing input validation and hardcoded sequence length were found.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"-   **Performance**: Inefficient model loading and synchronous file I/O were noted.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"-   **Test Quality**: Lack of unit tests and hardcoded test data were observed.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"### Artifacts Created","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md`","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md`","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md`","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"-   `docs/review/week1-review.md`","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
