2026-06-09 15:09:07,360 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"2","timestampMicros":"1781014147359801","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"67fd0278b72768f3779e926669c44a2c","trajectoryId":"67fd0278b72768f3779e926669c44a2c","stepIndex":0,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_USER","target":"TARGET_MODEL","thinking":"","textDelta":"Here is the current memory:\n\n# Agent Memory\n\nThis document serves as a record of the agent's past actions and key findings.\n\n## Session: 2026-06-09\n\n### Objective\nPerform a security, quality, and guardrails audit of the AI Agronomist platform.\n\n### Actions Taken\n1.  Reviewed code changes from the ML Engineer, Backend Engineer, and Tech Lead.\n2.  Created ADRs for the architecture, synthetic data, and modular architecture.\n3.  Generated a final review report with a summary of findings and action items.\n\n### Key Findings\n-   **Security**: High-risk raw SQL queries were identified.\n-   **Correctness**: Missing input validation and hardcoded sequence length were found.\n-   **Performance**: Inefficient model loading and synchronous file I/O were noted.\n-   **Test Quality**: Lack of unit tests and hardcoded test data were observed.\n\n### Artifacts Created\n-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md`\n-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md`\n-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md`\n-   `docs/review/week1-review.md`\n\n\nHere is the new execution result:\n\nTask: Implement the improvements proposed in final_review_report.md.\n\n1. ml-engineer:\n   - Create `src/models/postprocessing.py` to extract post-processing logic (timestamp mapping, clipping, extracting high anomalies) out of `src/api/routes/inference.py`.\n   - Update `src/config.py` to include `ANOMALY_THRESHOLD = 0.8` and `ANOMALY_SCALING_FACTOR = 2.0`.\n   - Update `src/api/routes/inference.py` to use these decoupled functions and config values.\n\n2. backend-engineer:\n   - Refactor `/api/inference/upload` in `src/api/routes/inference.py` to process the uploaded CSV via chunked DataFrames or generators to prevent memory exhaustion.\n   - Improve the timestamp mapping robustness during sequence windowing.\n   - Implement an LRU cache (e.g. `functools.lru_cache` or `cachetools`) in `src/models/model_registry.py` or inference routes to prevent unbounded model memory leaks.\n\n3. tech-lead:\n   - Update `src/dashboard/pages/5_upload_operations.py` to import `ANOMALY_THRESHOLD` from `src.config` instead of hardcoding `0.8`.\n   - Add frontend validation ensuring Tenant ID and Greenhouse ID are not empty before dispatching API calls.\n   - Correct the UI notification for model training from \"Training completed successfully!\" to correctly reflect its asynchronous background nature (\"Training dispatched in the background\").\nBuilt files:\n- [x] ml_engineer_changes.md\n- [x] backend_engineer_changes.md\n- [x] tech_lead_changes.md\n- [x] final_review.md\nFailed files:\n\n\nReturn the updated AGENT_MEMORY.md file content.","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Here is the current memory:\n\n# Agent Memory\n\nThis document serves as a record of the agent's past actions and key findings.\n\n## Session: 2026-06-09\n\n### Objective\nPerform a security, quality, and guardrails audit of the AI Agronomist platform.\n\n### Actions Taken\n1.  Reviewed code changes from the ML Engineer, Backend Engineer, and Tech Lead.\n2.  Created ADRs for the architecture, synthetic data, and modular architecture.\n3.  Generated a final review report with a summary of findings and action items.\n\n### Key Findings\n-   **Security**: High-risk raw SQL queries were identified.\n-   **Correctness**: Missing input validation and hardcoded sequence length were found.\n-   **Performance**: Inefficient model loading and synchronous file I/O were noted.\n-   **Test Quality**: Lack of unit tests and hardcoded test data were observed.\n\n### Artifacts Created\n-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md`\n-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md`\n-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md`\n-   `docs/review/week1-review.md`\n\n\nHere is the new execution result:\n\nTask: Implement the improvements proposed in final_review_report.md.\n\n1. ml-engineer:\n   - Create `src/models/postprocessing.py` to extract post-processing logic (timestamp mapping, clipping, extracting high anomalies) out of `src/api/routes/inference.py`.\n   - Update `src/config.py` to include `ANOMALY_THRESHOLD = 0.8` and `ANOMALY_SCALING_FACTOR = 2.0`.\n   - Update `src/api/routes/inference.py` to use these decoupled functions and config values.\n\n2. backend-engineer:\n   - Refactor `/api/inference/upload` in `src/api/routes/inference.py` to process the uploaded CSV via chunked DataFrames or generators to prevent memory exhaustion.\n   - Improve the timestamp mapping robustness during sequence windowing.\n   - Implement an LRU cache (e.g. `functools.lru_cache` or `cachetools`) in `src/models/model_registry.py` or inference routes to prevent unbounded model memory leaks.\n\n3. tech-lead:\n   - Update `src/dashboard/pages/5_upload_operations.py` to import `ANOMALY_THRESHOLD` from `src.config` instead of hardcoding `0.8`.\n   - Add frontend validation ensuring Tenant ID and Greenhouse ID are not empty before dispatching API calls.\n   - Correct the UI notification for model training from \"Training completed successfully!\" to correctly reflect its asynchronous background nature (\"Training dispatched in the background\").\nBuilt files:\n- [x] ml_engineer_changes.md\n- [x] backend_engineer_changes.md\n- [x] tech_lead_changes.md\n- [x] final_review.md\nFailed files:\n\n\nReturn the updated AGENT_MEMORY.md file content."}}
