egrated constants in `src/config.py`. The background training dispatch is complete.\n\n\n**Improving Upload Handling**\n\nI've significantly improved the `/api/routes/inference.py` route for CSV uploads. I've implemented memory-safe, chunked processing and integrated an LRU caching decorator within the model registration and inference flow to mitigate potential memory issues from repeated model loading. I've also hardened timestamp mapping and refactored the dashboard to use the anomaly threshold. I've added frontend validation to ensure tenant and greenhouse IDs are present. I've updated the training UI dispatcher to reflect background operation.\n\n\n","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"**Improving Upload Handling**\n\nI've significantly improved the `/api/routes/inference.py` route for CSV uploads. I've implemented memory-safe, chunked processing and integrated an LRU caching decorator within the model registration and inference flow to mitigate potential memory issues from repeated model loading. I've also hardened timestamp mapping and refactored the dashboard to use the anomaly threshold. I've added frontend validation to ensure tenant and greenhouse IDs are present. I've updated the training UI dispatcher to reflect background operation.\n\n\n","text":""}}
