2026-06-09 15:09:43,910 - root - INFO - RAW WS MSG: {"seqNum":"17","timestampMicros":"1781014183909890","stepUpdate":{"cascadeId":"67fd0278b72768f3779e926669c44a2c","trajectoryId":"67fd0278b72768f3779e926669c44a2c","stepIndex":5,"state":"STATE_DONE","source":"SOURCE_MODEL","target":"TARGET_ENVIRONMENT","thinking":"","textDelta":"","thinkingDelta":"","text":"Update agent memory file","editFile":{"filePath":"file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/AGENT_MEMORY.md","diffBlock":[{"startLine":0,"endLine":25,"lines":[{"text":"# Agent Memory","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"},{"text":"This document serves as a record of the agent's past actions and key findings.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"## Session: 2026-06-09","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Objective","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"Perform a security, quality, and guardrails audit of the AI Agronomist platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Actions Taken","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"1.  Reviewed code changes from the ML Engineer, Backend Engineer, and Tech Lead.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"2.  Created ADRs for the architecture, synthetic data, and modular architecture.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"3.  Generated a final review report with a summary of findings and action items.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Key Findings","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"-   **Security**: High-risk raw SQL queries were identified.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"-   **Correctness**: Missing input validation and hardcoded sequence length were found.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"-   **Performance**: Inefficient model loading and synchronous file I/O were noted.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"-   **Test Quality**: Lack of unit tests and hardcoded test data were observed.","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"### Artifacts Created","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md`","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md`","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"-   `docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md`","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"-   `docs/review/week1-review.md`","action":"LINE_ACTION_DELETE"},{"text":"This document serves as a record of the agent's past actions, completed tasks, and current state.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Current Phase","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"Implementation and consolidation of security, quality, and guardrail improvements based on the audit findings.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Completed Tasks","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Audit and Architecture Documentation**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Performed a security, quality, and guardrails audit of the AI Agronomist platform.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Created architectural decision records:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - [ADR-001-architecture.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-001-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - [ADR-002-synthetic-data.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-002-synthetic-data.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"    - [ADR-003-modular-architecture.md](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/docs/team/ADRs/ADR-003-modular-architecture.md)","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Generated the final review report: `docs/review/week1-review.md`.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Machine Learning Refactor (ML Engineer)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Created [postprocessing.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/models/postprocessing.py) to decouple post-processing logic (clipping, timestamp mapping, high anomaly extraction) from the routing code.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Added modular configuration constants `ANOMALY_THRESHOLD = 0.8` and `ANOMALY_SCALING_FACTOR = 2.0` to [config.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/config.py).","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Updated [inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/routes/inference.py) routes to consume decoupled post-processing features.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Backend Memory and Robustness Hardening (Backend Engineer)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Refactored `/api/inference/upload` in [inference.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/api/routes/inference.py) to parse uploaded CSV files in chunks/generators, avoiding out-of-memory crashes on large files.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Hardened timestamp mapping logic for robustness during sequence windowing.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Configured LRU caching mechanism inside model resolution flows to prevent memory exhaustion from repeated model loading.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **UI & Dashboard Adjustments (Tech Lead)**:","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Standardized anomaly thresholds across dashboard/pages in [5_upload_operations.py](file:///Users/eugenesidorov/Projects/ai-agronomist/src/dashboard/pages/5_upload_operations.py) by importing `ANOMALY_THRESHOLD` instead of using a hardcoded literal value.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Added frontend-side validation checkpoints to verify that Tenant ID and Greenhouse ID are populated before dispatching requests.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"  - Refined model training notifications in UI to correctly inform the user that training is asynchronously dispatched rather than claiming immediate completion.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Pending / Next Steps","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Verify the end-to-end correctness of chunked DataFrame generation.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Integrate automated unit, security, and edge-case testing validating the decoupled post-processing logic.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Conduct load and stress testing on large multi-megabyte CSV uploads to verify memory usage remains bounded.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- Perform code-coverage analysis to ensure target coverage of >80% is met on all modified execution paths.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"## Technical Notes","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Safety**: Unchecked uploads are guarded by streamed and chunked generators to keep RAM consumption deterministic.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Caching**: The LRU cache configuration enforces strict upper boundaries on loaded model weights.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"- **Coupling Rules**: Fully adheres to `no_tight_coupling` guidelines. Common domain models and configuration schemas are centralized.","action":"LINE_ACTION_INSERT"},{"text":"","action":"LINE_ACTION_NONE"}]}]}}}
